  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681374"
  },
  "name": "Abiotic Factor",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Shooter\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\",\"Simulation\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Co-op\",\"First-Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"FPS\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Exploration\",\"Sandbox\",\"Survival\",\"Early Access\",\"Crafting\",\"Aliens\",\"Building\",\"Base Building\",\"PvE\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Immersive Sim\",\"Science\",\"Co-op Campaign\",\"LAN Co-op\",\"Open World Survival Craft\"]",
  "publisher": "PlayStack",
  "description": "As a member of the science team trapped by a trans-dimensional experiment gone sideways, you must forge a path to safety. Employ your big-brain talents to stay alive in a doomed facility, use a spectrum of scavenged resources, craft weird-science gadgets, hack into new sectors, and escape to the surface with your team … Explore every inch of the underground GATE Cascade Research Facility, from the ravaged Office Sector to the heavy machinery and mines of Manufacturing, through the secret labs – and dimensions beyond – in a retro world re-imagined for modern multiplayer co-op. Craft an assortment of smart science tools, food, gear, and weapons to defeat denizens from a myriad of worlds – gain the advantage against alien enemies and paranormal ‘problems’ by getting sneaky, smart or downright devious. Grow your geek skills and stats to develop a carefully balanced interplay of strengths and weaknesses. Select your traits (both good and bad) based on your scientist’s hobbies and talents (or lack thereof) – are you a fast learner? Do you need to use the restroom more often? Are you a restless sleeper? Or maybe you cook like a pro? Customize to your heart’s content – as long as your tie matches. And just remember egghead, you’re super-smart, not superhuman. After all, you’re with the science team.Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/abiotic-factor",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/37a/37a2d3e2ef38c51785b05a08cf58c311.jpg",
