  "name": "One-Eyed Likho",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Story Rich\",\"Horror\",\"Exploration\",\"Mystery\",\"Walking Simulator\",\"Multiple Endings\",\"Stylized\",\"Interactive Fiction\",\"Supernatural\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Psychological\",\"Mythology\",\"Thriller\",\"Psychedelic\",\"philosophical\",\"Custom Volume Controls\",\"Stereo Sound\",\"Playable without Timed Input\"]",
  "publisher": "Morteshka",
  "description": "Don’t Go Looking For Evil, You May Find The Likho… One-Eyed Likho is a mystical first-person horror adventure in which you have to find Likho and escape your own evil fate. Features Folk horror – Explore a game world inspired by a Slavic fairy-tale recorded in the early 19th century Story-focused exploration – Progress through the game to uncover secrets and learn the whole truth Unique style - A captivating world rendered in mesmerizing greyscale Burn mechanics – Solve fire-based puzzles and light your way with matches Authentic fairy tale The gam… Read more",
