{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681386"
  },
  "name": "Grounded 2",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"Third Person\",\"Horror\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Exploration\",\"Sandbox\",\"Survival\",\"Early Access\",\"Crafting\",\"Base Building\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Open World Survival Craft\"]",
  "publisher": "Xbox Game Studios",
  "description": "When you've been shrunk to the size of an ant, what was once familiar is now a wild, uncharted frontier. Traverse sprawling manmade spaces overgrown with nature with buggies that can fight alongside with you, uncover hidden secrets, and fight to survive in a world much larger than the backyard. The playground may seem familiar, but beneath its bright colors and towering structures lie mysteries hidden in plain sight. Are you ready to uncover them? Survive, Adapt, Overcome The world is relentless, but so are you. Shape your adventure with… Read more",
