  "name": "Katanaut",
  "genre": "[\"Action\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Horror\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"Replay Value\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Side Scroller\",\"Roguelike\",\"Fast-Paced\",\"Metroidvania\",\"Roguelite\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Souls-like\",\"Lovecraftian\",\"Ninja\",\"Action Roguelike\",\"Custom Volume Controls\",\"Stereo Sound\",\"Playable without Timed Input\",\"Roguevania\",\"Camera Comfort\",\"Surround Sound\",\"Adjustable Difficulty\",\"Subtitle Options\",\"Adjustable Text Size\",\"Color Alternatives\",\"Рогалик-метроидвания\",\"Keyboard Only Option\",\"Save Anytime\"]",
  "publisher": "Acclaim",
  "description": "Katanaut is a fast-paced , Metroidvania-inspired action roguelite set aboard a massive space station falling into cosmic chaos. With the station slowly spiraling out of control, and its once-human inhabitants twisted into terrors, you’re the unlucky one tasked with uncovering what is going on... assuming you’re able to survive the station's violent halls with souls-like combat. As Naut , you explore the corridors of this once vibrant station... or what's left of it. The deeper you descend into the station, the environments become more haunting, and the enemies less… Read more",
