  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"FPS\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"Roguelike\",\"Roguelite\",\"Steampunk\",\"Dungeon Crawler\",\"PvE\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Arena Shooter\",\"Underwater\",\"Action Roguelike\",\"looter shooter\",\"Лутер-шутер\",\"Арена-шутер\",\"submarine\",\"Custom Volume Controls\"]",
  "publisher": "The Arcade Crew",
  "description": "Gather your friends and dive into Abyssus' fast-paced multiplayer shooting action. Fight through gorgeous hand-crafted levels in a roguelite adventure that will put your tactical skills to the ultimate test. Wield powerful brine-powered weapons and refit them with ancient technologies to gain an edge over your foes. Obtain divine blessings to enhance your firepower with elemental and mystic effects. In a world powered by brine, a rare and powerful substance only found in the deepest fathoms of the sea, your team of daring… Read more",
