  "name": "RoboCop: Rogue City - Unfinished Business",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"First-Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"FPS\",\"Gore\",\"Violent\",\"Action RPG\",\"Dark\",\"Mature\",\"Futuristic\",\"Cyberpunk\",\"Crime\",\"Dystopian\",\"Robots\",\"city\",\"Family Sharing\",\"weapons\",\"police\",\"Traps\",\"jet\",\"business\",\"machine\",\"enemies\",\"town\",\"rogue\",\"man\",\"skull\"]",
  "publisher": "Nacon",
  "description": "Following RoboCop's decisive victory over Detroit's gangs, a new chapter unfolds in this standalone extension set after the events of RoboCop: Rogue City. The New Guy in Town has been defeated, but the streets are still riddled with crime. A spark of hope comes from OCP’s latest project: OmniTower – a massive housing complex designed specifically to provide for the needs of the residents of Old Detroit. But when a group of highly trained mercenaries armed with cutting-edge weapons takes control of the building and turns it into their deadly fortress, RoboCop must ta… Read more",
