  },
  "name": "s.p.l.i.t",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Simulation\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Horror\",\"Dark\",\"3D\",\"Multiple Endings\",\"Linear\",\"Emotional\",\"Interactive Fiction\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Thriller\",\"Hacking\",\"Typing\"]",
  "publisher": "Mike Klubnika",
  "description": "\"s.p.l.i.t\" is a short narrative driven horror game, with a focus on raw terminal hacking using various commands. Throughout the game, you chat with your fellow technicians in order to plan and execute a malware attack. Regardless of the outcome, your story won't be told for decades. Will you hold up your end? FEATURES: First person gameplay with diegetic & immersive UI. An IRC chat where you gain intel, and learn more about the facility. A terminal where you run software, navigate directories, and execute commands. Detailed command prompt… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/split-3",
