  },
  "name": "Last Report",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Story Rich\",\"2D\",\"Horror\",\"Exploration\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Dark\",\"Point & Click\",\"Mystery\",\"Linear\",\"Interactive Fiction\",\"Supernatural\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Psychological\"]",
  "publisher": "Monopixel Games",
  "description": "Last Report is a dark horror game where you play as a night shift park ranger. While monitoring the camera footage, you start noticing strange events. Uncover the terrifying secret of Among Green Trees National Park. Something moved in the window, but don’t worry it’s probably just another deer, right? Review Camera Photo Reports – as a night shift park ranger, it’s your duty to check the camera reports, but the problem is that some of them are... strange? Experience the Dark and Terrifying History of Among Green Trees Park – as a park ranger, you must uncover… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/last-report",
