  "publisher": "Goblinz Publishing",
  "description": "Day of the Shell: Prologue is the free version of Day of the Shell. It is a fast-paced tactical roguelite, where each turn is played in a single click. The gods have brought down their wrath on humanity, and only a few remote islands remain. A lonely monster huntress has risen to challenge and appease the gods, traveling through what's left of the world. PROLOGUE FEATURES 1 world, 13 islands to explore 2 weapons: revolver and crossbow 9 blessings and 12 relics to combine 7 runes to permanently improve the Huntress’s passive skills 5 unique enemies … Read more",
