{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa126813a7"
  },
  "name": "Mage Arena",
  "genre": "[\"Action\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Multiplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Co-op\",\"First-Person\",\"FPS\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Action RPG\",\"Early Access\",\"PvP\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Crafting\",\"combat\",\"Medieval\",\"Magic\",\"Online PvP\",\"Cartoony\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Immersive Sim\",\"esports\",\"Stereo Sound\",\"Playable without Timed Input\",\"Surround Sound\"]",
  "publisher": "jrsjams",
  "description": "DUE TO A LARGE NUMBER OF BUGS THE GAME HAS TEMPORARILY BEEN DISCOUNTED TO 2.99 IT WILL BE RAISED TO 4.99 ONCE STABLEChoose your side in an up to 4v4 voice controlled battle between the sorcerers and warlocks or challenge your rival to a 1v1 in the Mage Colosseum Channel your voice to cast fireballs, shoot frostbolts, conjure wormholes, and fire arcane blasts to vanquish your foes by speaking the correct words.For thousands of years sorcerers and warlocks have waged war for the title of supremacy in the arcane arts. Now, it is your turn to enter the fray. Overseen by The Goblin Archmagus, this battle will take place inside of the Mage Arena. The Mage Arena is an ever changing island, filled with fantastical landscapes to explore.Utilize the resources of the land to craft useful items to gain an edge over your opponents.In order to claim victory, you must infiltrate your opponents base and capture their flag pole. Once captured the Goblin Archmagus will deem them unworthy of resurrection, meaning once you eliminate each member of the opposing team, victory is yours. Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/mage-arena-3",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/cfe/cfe26895a9832d6ee5d096143fe387fb.jpg",
