  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"2D\",\"Comedy\",\"Anime\",\"Crafting\",\"Visual Novel\",\"Romance\",\"2D Fighter\",\"Family Sharing\",\"2D Platformer\",\"2D-платформер\",\"2D-файтинг\",\"Foreign\"]",
  "publisher": "Sekai Project",
  "description": "This is a casual and puzzle puzzle game where the complete image is randomly shuffled into 4 * 4 small images each time. The position of each small image is random, and you need to assemble them into a complete image (in order to make the image move, the final puzzle will be 1/16 smaller). Suitable for: Those who enjoy puzzles or have free time to exercise their brainpower can repeat the challenge. Features included: Game interface composition: one image divided into 16 pieces, The position of each pieces is random Game steps: Click the… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/childhood-friends",
