  "name": "Fill Up The Hole",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"2D\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Building\",\"Dystopian\",\"Management\",\"Base Building\",\"Resource Management\",\"City Builder\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Clicker\",\"Colony Sim\",\"idler\",\"Idle-игра\",\"Custom Volume Controls\",\"Playable without Timed Input\",\"Mouse Only Option\",\"Save Anytime\"]",
  "publisher": "Fluffy Lotus",
  "description": "Fill Up The Hole is a short incremental game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features. Throw Garbage Your peons automatically gather garbage and throw it into the hole. The more they throw, the more progress you make! Create a Village Expand your village, put your peons to work, and maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown. Upgrade Unlock upgrades and abilities to enhance your buildings and peons. Gameplay… Read more",
