{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa126813b1"
  },
  "name": "Keep on Mining!",
  "genre": "[\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"2D\",\"Cute\",\"Colorful\",\"Management\",\"Relaxing\",\"Loot\",\"Resource Management\",\"Economy\",\"Minimalist\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Clicker\",\"Capitalism\",\"Mining\",\"collectathon\",\"idler\",\"Idle-игра\",\"Cozy\",\"Custom Volume Controls\",\"Playable without Timed Input\",\"Mouse Only Option\"]",
  "publisher": "EagleEye Games",
  "description": "Mine rocks! Keep on Mining! is a simple incremental game. Hover your cursor over rocks to automatically mine them. Any rock inside the mining area will spawn pickaxes that mine for you! Gather materials! Mined rocks drop ores, which are crafted into bars. There is a variety of different material rocks to be mined! The skill tree! Spend your material bars to unlock upgrades inside the skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you mine rocks with more power! Craft pickaxes! Use different materials to craft new pickaxes. Each new pickaxe… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/keep-on-mining",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/418/41807473c69a8da7a515768c26159603.jpg",
