  "name": "Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time Remake",
  "genre": "[\"Action\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Classic\",\"Remake\"]",
  "publisher": "Ubisoft Entertainment",
  "description": "The Prince has returned! Experience the classic tale that redefined action-adventure gaming in this full-scale remake for a new generation. You are the Prince of Persia. Embark on a journey to save your kingdom from the treacherous Vizier. Master the Sands of Time and use your dagger to reverse, accelerate, freeze, and slow time itself. Fight cursed enemies and solve puzzles along the way. Experience incredible graphical enhancements and re-designed gameplay mechanics. Unlock Prince of Persia, the original game from 1989, along your journey.",
