  "publisher": "Annapurna Interactive",
  "description": "From the makers of LEGO® Builder's Journey comes a new 2-player co-op adventure about friendship and play. When two friends make it their mission to rescue an abandoned spaceship, they embark on a journey beyond their wildest dreams, ultimately learning the value of being connected. Experience what it feels like to be a LEGO brick. Tumble, jump, snap together, and build your way through rich brick worlds. Unravel a poetic, non verbal narrative, set in beautiful brick built environments, supported by an atmospheric soundtrack. Cooperatively solve the game's many… Read more",
