  "publisher": "Zyg Studios",
  "description": "Formula 2D - Steer To Persevere is a top of the line Formula Racing game where mild similarities with real racing are entirely coincidental - Create and customize your team 🏎️ - Upgrade your facilities to improve your car 🏗️ - Become the world champion in campaign mode 🏁 - Compete with players worldwide in asynchronous multiplayer 🏆 - Play Co-Op with up to 8+ players 🎮👨‍👦​ DRS, pit stops, weather changes—use every tool at your disposal to outsmart and outpace your rivals. Every decision counts. - 20+ Tracks from all over the world - Weather changes - Tyre strategies - DRS management - And so much more...",
