{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268140d"
  },
  "name": "Zombie Pandemia 2D",
  "genre": "[\"Free To Play Games\",\"Action\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\",\"Free To Play\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Zombies\",\"Shooter\",\"2D\",\"Top-Down Shooter\",\"Post-apocalyptic\",\"Dark\",\"Horror\",\"Emotional\",\"Level Editor\",\"Retro\",\"Survival Horror\",\"Sandbox\",\"Casual\",\"Thriller\",\"Top-Down\",\"Shoot 'Em Up\",\"Action\",\"Singleplayer\",\"Violent\",\"Free to Play\"]",
  "publisher": "SpaceGhostTriFF",
  "description": "➤ Become a Zombie Slayer: Master the 15 powerful weapons, outwit hordes of the undead, and survive the carnage. ➤ Customize Your Arsenal: Skins and muzzle flash effects, all available on the Black Market! ➤ Follow Unique Stories: Step into the shoes of 4 different protagonists, each with a gripping tale of loss, survival, and relentless determination. 𝐍𝐨 𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐲, 𝐨𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐛𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐬; 𝐖𝐞 𝐜𝐚𝐫𝐯𝐞 𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐬𝐮𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐯𝐚𝐥 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐞𝐚𝐜𝐡 𝐬𝐡𝐨𝐭 𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐭 𝐫𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐞𝐬 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐮𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐚𝐝 𝐭𝐨 𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐭𝐞𝐬𝐪𝐮𝐞 𝐩𝐢𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐟𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐡. Zombie Pandemia 2D takes you into a haunting world where survival is a brutal, daily battle. Civilization is gone—replaced by ruins and despair. Every moment is a test of your skills, wit, and courage in the face of overwhelming odds. Key Features: • Engaging Storylines: Explore emotional, action-packed journeys with multiple protagonists fighting for their lives and loved ones. • Dynamic Gameplay: Outrun, outsmart, and obliterate the undead in stunning 2D visuals. • Immersive Customization: Stand out with unique skins, muzzle flashes, and an arsenal tailored to your playstyle. Choose Your Path: ♠ Fight for justice as a brave police officer. ♣ Embrace the chaos as a survivor who finds joy in slaying zombies. ♥ Struggle for hope as a parent searching for their family. ♦ Face the apocalypse head-on to reunite with your lost sibling. How to Survive the Pandemia: • Use strategy and precision to clear hordes of zombies. • Master a variety of weapons and tactics to conquer each level. • Save up mines and miniguns for the intense situations. • Explore our dedicated forum for shared strategies, uncover hidden secrets, and dive deeper into the game’s lore. Also, have some fun in a general discussion. • Unravel clues about the virus through notes, radio signals, and scattered evidence. Will You Survive the Apocalypse or Succumb to Chaos? The world is in ruins, and survival is the only option. Join the fight now—Zombie Pandemia 2D awaits. Embark on a relentless battle for survival!",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3316360/Zombie_Pandemia_2D/?snr=1_7_7_151_150_2",
  "image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316360/header.jpg?t=1744717641",
