{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268140e"
  },
  "name": "Backrooms Maze 2D",
  "genre": "[\"Indie Games\",\"Adventure\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"2D\",\"Exploration\",\"Dungeon Crawler\",\"Roguelite\",\"Casual\",\"Puzzle\",\"Adventure\",\"PvE\",\"Tutorial\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Psychological Horror\",\"Procedural Generation\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Indie\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"Dark\",\"Survival Horror\",\"Grid-Based Movement\",\"Singleplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Insanity Studios LLC",
  "description": "🚨 WARNING: The maze has grown more dangerous. Our brave pricing team ventured too deep into Level 0 and never returned… but they left one final message: “Raise the price.” So during Steam’s Fall Sale, instead of a discount, Backrooms Maze 2D is now $9.99. It’s not a bug. It’s not a glitch. It’s a threat. Backrooms Maze 2D throws you into the unsettling, yellow-lit halls of the Backrooms — endless, shifting corridors where escape is your only goal and danger lurks around every corner.Each run generates a brand-new maze filled with eerie ambience, lurking entities, and a ticking sanity meter that forces you to think fast. You can choose from four difficulty modes: Easy – A calmer experience with slower enemies. Normal – More challenge and faster chases. Hard – Two relentless enemies hunting you. Extreme – Five fast enemies for the ultimate survival test. Your only tools are your sense of direction and your ability to outmaneuver the entities. Every choice you make matters — one wrong turn could lead straight into danger. Procedurally Generated Mazes – Every run feels fresh and unpredictable. Multiple Difficulty Levels – From casual to near-impossible survival. Sanity System – Stay on the move or risk losing control. Retro Visual Style – Simple, pixel-inspired characters with basic animation. AI Enemies – Enemies that roam, chase, and block your path. Immersive Audio – Ambient hum, footsteps, and pause effects. Settings Menu – Adjust brightness, master volume, and sound levels. Multi-Language Support – Play in 25+ languages. Quick Restart – Escape or get caught, then jump right back in.",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3952680/Backrooms_Maze_2D/?snr=1_7_7_151_150_2",
  "image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952680/3656fd8bcf89f984585e73d46229cc57049915e7/header.jpg?t=1758856593",
