  "description": "Keep Talking and Nobody Explodes is a game about defusing a bomb. It was initially made for virtual reality headsets but also supports traditional screens and controls. Player cooperation The game is meant to be played by at least two people in cooperation. Only one of them is wearing the VR headset or actually interacts with the computer. He or she acts as the main defuser who has to deactivate the bomb. All other players assume the roles of the experts. Their task is to help the defuser by reading aloud a manual about bombs. The experts need to be either in the same room with the defus… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/keep-talking-and-nobody-explodes",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/e88/e88ccd83bb2d69ad04d18b06c5e0df3d.jpg",
