{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268143b"
  },
  "name": "The Bridge",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\",\"Puzzle\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"2D\",\"Difficult\",\"Physics\",\"Surreal\",\"Hand-drawn\",\"puzzles\"]",
  "publisher": "Midnight City",
  "description": "The goal of the game is to pass level by level, finding an exit from each to the next. The difficulty, the challenge and at the same time the solution is that the levels are designed in the world of drawings by M. C. Escher. Top, bottom, right, left, floor, ceiling, stairs and walls are not in their usual places, not fixed and pass into each other quite differently than in the real world. However, the solution is sought precisely by turning over, rotating and other unusual, impossible actions with all this. 48 puzzles await the hero throughout the game. Each puzzle has its own unique solution. After… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/the-bridge",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/5a3/5a36930b16d9b1949d8c8c92b5a28d89.jpg",
