  "publisher": "Rusty Lake",
  "description": "Welcome our guests to the Rusty Lake Hotel and make sure they will have a pleasant stay. There will be 5 dinners this week. Make sure every dinner is worth dying for! Rusty Lake Hotel a unique puzzle-escape game with a surreal, strange setting inspired by David Lynch’s TV series Twin Peaks. Key features: Pick-up-and-play: easy to start, but it will be hard to stop Tons of puzzles: a total of 6 rooms full of unique and various brain teasers Thrilling and engaging story: there will be 5 dinners with intriguing guests and staff Full of suspense and atmosphere: Rusty … Read more",
