{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268143f"
  },
  "name": "Divide By Sheep",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Casual\",\"Educational\",\"Indie\",\"Puzzle\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"2D\",\"Cute\"]",
  "publisher": "tinyBuild",
  "description": "Divide By Sheep is a math puzzler about the Grim Reaper's devious plan to make some sheepy friends. Grim can only befriend the dead, so he decided to unleash a great flood and drag the sheep under. Now stranded on small islands and sinking fast, the sheep need you to help them reach safety. You save the little animals by solving clever math puzzles. Divide By Sheep is a game of addition and subtraction by any means possible, where puzzles start off fairly easy and playful, yet quickly escalate in both difficulty and dark humor. The mighty features: 120… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/divide-by-sheep",
