  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"2D\",\"Difficult\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Building\",\"Management\",\"overlay\",\"Relaxing\",\"achievements\",\"Minimalist\",\"Touch-Friendly\",\"Education\",\"Mouse only\",\"Solo\",\"leaderboards\",\"Trains\",\"transportation\"]",
  "publisher": "AGM PLAYISM",
  "description": "Mini Metro is an indie puzzle strategy game about building a rail transit network. You have to provide transport in continually growing cities by building stations, railways and disposing of trains. The number of passengers continually increases, and once any of the stations reaches its capacity limit, the game is over. With each in-game week, you get new trains and upgrades that allow you to upgrade stations capacity or give you additional tunnels, rail lines or train carriages. Every level in Mini Metro is based on the real city. Some of them have their unique features like … Read more",
