  "publisher": "Kiss",
  "description": "Q.U.B.E: Director's Cut is a puzzle game developed by Toxic games. The Director's Cut adds new story elements to the game and new voice acted lines along with new levels and music. VR support was also added. The players find themselves in a sterile environment aboard a mysterious space cube-like ship that is on a collision course with Earth. The player is contacted with by another astronaut that warns the player that they have to find a way to find a way off the ship which will cause it to self-destruct. You set out on your mission. Upon coming to, you find yourself in a suit and with a… Read more",
