  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"2D\",\"Third Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Free to Play\",\"Retro\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"Realistic\",\"Physics\",\"Cinematic\",\"combat\",\"Robots\",\"Steampunk\",\"Puzzle-Platformer\",\"Destruction\",\"Class-Based\",\"Mechs\",\"3D Fighter\",\"3D-файтинг\"]",
  "publisher": "Evolved Games",
  "description": "Vessel is a game about an engineer who operates machines in a heavily industrialized steampunk world. The player assumes the role of Arkwright, a genius scientist who invented a new type of automaton called Fluro. The Fluros are amorphous creatures that can be made of any type of liquid and perform tasks for people. One day, the Fluros mutated and went out of control, ruining most of the world’s machines. Arkwright has to find the cause of the malfunction and restore control over the Fluros. The gameplay consists of solving physics-based puzzles and manipulating the ridiculously compl… Read more",
