  },
  "name": "Alpha Squadron",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Arcade\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Co-Op\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Space\",\"War\",\"Cinematic\",\"combat\",\"Linear\",\"Shoot 'Em Up\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Remote Play Together\",\"Shared/Split Screen Co-op\",\"Flight\",\"fight\",\"race\",\"fun\",\"work\",\"planets\",\"galaxy\",\"fast\",\"dodge\",\"android\",\"laser\",\"ships\",\"doom\"]",
  "publisher": "Ender Toone",
  "description": "This is a Side Scrolling Shooting game where you dodge flying enemy ships and their bullets. At the end of each level there is a Boss to defeat before moving onto the next level. When playing Multiplayer, if any player completes the level everyone starts the next level. This is a Pure Gameplay game Do you even know how to Dodge a bullet? This side scrolling shooter has been created to highlight the playable aspects of the game. Which means we have no story, we have no extravagant graphics, we have no epic cut-scenes. Have fun.",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/alpha-squadron",
