  },
  "name": "Bit Blaster XL",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"2D\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Difficult\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Survival\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Controller\",\"Retro\",\"Space\",\"Family Friendly\",\"Replay Value\",\"Shoot 'Em Up\",\"Bullet Hell\",\"Score Attack\"]",
  "publisher": "Nickervision Studios",
  "description": "I have been learning to make games in my free time and love making small-yet-solid arcade games with simple mechanics. Please expect 'Bit Blaster XL' to be a small, re-playable, arcade score-chaser game where the only goals are to constantly beat your previous score and unlock some extra ships. I greatly appreciate feedback and will do my best to ensure support for my games. Please contact me through Twitter, My Website, or the forums if you encounter something wrong with the game, something misleading on the store page, or you just want to say hello. Thank you for taking a moment to … Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/bit-blaster-xl",
