  },
  "name": "Ven Adventure",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Third Person\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family Friendly\",\"Cute\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"combat\",\"Relaxing\",\"Linear\",\"3D Platformer\",\"Cartoony\",\"Emotional\",\"Precision Platformer\"]",
  "publisher": "Monologic Games",
  "description": "Ven Adventure is a single-player 3D platform game. You happen to meet Ven on his unknown planet, invaded by Bruce Nelson, who wants to destroy the surrounding magical world and gain access to energy that can make him virtually immortal. Be the hero to help Ven save his planet from destruction.Features:Take on an adventure through a magical land.Team up and work closely with Ven and use everything you can to save his world. Be the hero who helps Ven save his planet from destruction. Submerge yourself in a world of magic, invaded by machines and deadly enemies, full of traps and dangers.Save all of Ven’s little companions.Challenge yourself by trying to finish each level in a time trial mode and many other modes, comparing your performance against a global leaderboards.Perfect for casual players as well as those who are looking for challengeShow less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/ven-adventure",
