  "description": "River Tails: Stronger Together is a 3D co-op adventure platformer with a colourful cartoon aesthetic. Teammates must work together to defeat end-of-level bosses and solve puzzles across a range of natural-world environments. Play either as Furple , the curious and excitable purple kitten, or Finn , the independent fish with a bit of an attitude problem. You’ll embark upstream with these unexpected allies, towards the icy mountain where Furple’s family are in mortal danger. Can you save them in time? * River Tails: Stronger Together requires a controller in order t… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/river-tails-stronger-together",
