  "name": "Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Classic\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Space\",\"role-playing\",\"Moddable\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Choices Matter\",\"Real-Time with Pause\",\"Party-Based RPG\",\"Star Wars\",\"Single player only\"]",
  "publisher": "Aspyr",
  "description": "The game takes place in the world of the epic \"Star Wars\". When creating a character, first select a class - Soldier, Scoundrel or Scout. Classes differ in the proportion of strength, health and cunning. Later, three more classes will open, each of which will be a Jedi: Jedi Guardian, Jedi Consular, and Jedi Sentinel. This will also be the choice in favour of different proportions of strength, intelligence and skills. In the world of \"Star Wars,\" there is a Force that can be vested both by the Jedi and by their enemies. There are Force Powers of three types: light, dark and neutral. They should be studied, this raises the… Read more",
