  "genre": "[\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Action RPG\",\"Character Customization\",\"Post-apocalyptic\",\"3D\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Realistic\",\"JRPG\",\"Turn-Based Combat\",\"Narration\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Party-Based RPG\",\"Постапокалипсис\",\"Однокористувацька гра\",\"Досягнення Steam\",\"Повна підтримка контролерів\",\"Сімейна бібліотека\"]",
  "publisher": "Kepler Interactive",
  "description": "Once a year, the Paintress wakes and paints upon her monolith. Paints her cursed number. And everyone of that age turns to smoke and fades away. Year by year, that number ticks down and more of us are erased. Tomorrow she’ll wake and paint “33.” And tomorrow we depart on our final mission - Destroy the Paintress, so she can never paint death again. We are Expedition 33.",
