  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Open World\",\"First-Person\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Choices Matter\",\"3D\",\"Realistic\",\"Historical\",\"combat\",\"Medieval\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"Alternate History\",\"Family Sharing\",\"LGBTQ+\",\"Political\",\"Swordplay\",\"immersive\"]",
  "publisher": "Deep Silver",
  "description": "Kingdom of Bohemia, Early 15th Century: chaos has befallen the kingdom. As invaders pillage this ungoverned land, sowing fear and terror, Henry of Skalitz seeks revenge for his murdered family. Now a trusted member of the rightful king’s allies, Henry is sent to escort Sir Hans Capon on a diplomatic mission. After they are ambushed and nearly killed, the two young men embark on a series of perilous adventures, putting their skills, character and friendship to the ultimate test.",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/kingdom-come-deliverance-ii",
