  "publisher": "Sony Computer Entertainment",
  "description": "Uncharted 4 is the final installment in the Uncharted series. The story follows Nathan Drake for the last time as he now searches for Captain Henry Avery's treasure. Introducing new characters such as Samuel Drake, with Sam and Sully Nathan agrees to find the treasure of the Gunsway heist in 1695. As antagonists, Nathan must face Rafe Adler and Nadine Ross while they are also trying to find this treasure and Nathan must face details about Sam's past. Now changing the game's concept, Naughty Dog made locations much bigger and more explorable. Expanding the… Read more",
