  "name": "Split Fiction",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Co-op\",\"Story Rich\",\"cooperative\",\"Third Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Co-Op\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Sexual Content\",\"3D Platformer\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Remote Play Together\",\"LGBTQ+\",\"Political\",\"Co-op Campaign\",\"Politics\",\"Succès Steam\",\"Compat. contrôleurs complète\",\"Cartes à échanger Steam\",\"Partage familial\",\"HDR disponible\",\"multijoueur\",\"Coopération en ligne\",\"Coopération\",\"Coop locale et écran partagé\",\"Écran partagé\",\"Multijoueur multiplateforme\",\"Sous-titres disponibles\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Embrace mind-blowing moments as you’re pulled deep into the many worlds of Split Fiction, a boundary-pushing co-op action adventure from the studio behind 2021 Game of the Year Winner, It Takes Two. Mio and Zoe are contrasting writers – one writes sci-fi and the other writes fantasy – who become trapped in their own stories after being hooked up to a machine designed to steal their creative ideas. They’ll have to rely on each other to break free with their memories in-tact, working together to master a variety of abilities and overcome diverse challenges while… Read more",
