  "name": "Yakuza 0",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Open World\",\"Third Person\",\"Funny\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Comedy\",\"Violent\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Anime\",\"Mature\",\"Sexual Content\",\"Beat 'em up\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Dating Sim\",\"Minigames\"]",
  "publisher": "SEGA",
  "description": "Yakuza 0 is an action-adventure game developed by Sega for Microsoft and PlayStation in 2015. Plot The game takes place in 1988 in Tokyo. The main characters are Kazuma Kiryu and Goro Majima, who are forced to participate in the power struggle of the Japan mafia organizations. Kiryu is framed for a murder and pursued by a huge mafia family. On the loose, the protagonist tries to prove innocent and reveal the truth behind the so-called Empty Lot conflict. The aim is to follow the plot and make choices based on different strategies. Gameplay The game is played from a third-person perspective. The pla… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/yakuza-0",
