  "name": "Project CARS",
  "genre": "[\"Simulation\",\"Sports\",\"Racing\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"Third Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Controller\",\"Realistic\",\"Physics\",\"VR\",\"Driving\",\"TrackIR\"]",
  "publisher": "Bandai Namco Entertainment",
  "description": "With the help of original technical solutions, the game manages to offer a fully dynamic SETA model of tires, as well as a system of dynamic day and weather change. The player feels how the car adjusts the behavior depending on the work of braking assistance or stability control. The game has more than 110 cars, their number is constantly growing. Each car has its distinct characteristics, in its own way behaves on the road. The game has about forty race tracks, and if you consider different configurations, you can count 110 variants of routes. Before the game you can set up the AI, controlling all the circumstances on the track, according to a variety of different criteria. Similarly, AI can be configured and in terms of management of other cars - what kind of rivals do you want to see around you?Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/project-cars",
