  "publisher": "2K Games",
  "description": "NBA 2K14 is the ninth installment in the 2K series of basketball simulators. This game is centered around LeBron James, the famous player from the Miami Heat club. Modes The game has a traditional MyCareer mode as well as an arcade mode. It also features a variety of online multiplayer modes. There are two new modes introduced in NBA 2K14. The story mode, called \"LeBron: Path to Greatness,\" was inspired by Jordan Challenge mode from the NBA 2K11. It follows an imaginary version of LeBron's career, in which the players control LeBron… Read more",
