  "publisher": "Team17 Digital",
  "description": "A golfing spin-off in the famous Worms series. Worms Crazy Golf - it's a familiar mix of the main series gameplay and classic golf transforming the latter into turn-based madness. Now the main goal is not to destroy all of the enemy’s worms. The goal is to get into the hole with fewer strikes. The game is a continuation of the mobile-exclusive Worms Golf and adaptation of the format on the PC. The player takes control of the worm, which appears on the 2D battlefield. The goal is to drive the ball into the hole. Sometimes on the way, there are explosive sheep that explode to shreds in a … Read more",
