  "description": "SSX is the return of the beloved franchise on the current generation of consoles where you can own the Planet across real-world iconic mountain ranges, compete and compare with friends online in totally new ways, and defy reality on a snowboard through Race it, Trick it and Survive it events. Defy Reality and Own the Planet with SSX. This item is being licensed or sublicensed to you by Sony Computer Entertainment America and is subject to the Network Terms of Service and User Agreement, this item’s use restrictions and other applicable terms located at www.us.playstation.com/support/useragreements. If you do not wish to accept all these terms, do not download this item. This item may be used with up to 2 activated PlayStation®3 systems associated with this Sony Entertainment Network account.Show less",
