  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"2D\",\"Funny\",\"Difficult\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Retro\",\"role-playing\",\"Captions available\",\"Management\",\"2D Fighter\"]",
  "publisher": "tinyBuild",
  "description": "Punch Club is a cross between sports management and The Sims, packed together in the retro pixel-art style. The plot is based on the 1980s and 1990s action movie staples and is full of ironic references and quotes from them. You play as a young boxing prodigy whose father was murdered by a stranger. Your goal is to become a great sportsman and win a tournament, but also to investigate and avenge your father’s death. The player controls his character around the clock, making him exercise, eat, go to the job, buy food and other items, and interact with other cha… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/punch-club",
