{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268155c"
  },
  "name": "Skate 3",
  "genre": "[\"Sports\",\"Arcade\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Physics\",\"city\",\"school\",\"combos\",\"simulator\",\"box\",\"gamepad\",\"hardcore\",\"skate\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Skate 3 is a skateboarding simulator developed by EA Black Box. It is the third game in the series and is a direct sequel to Skate 2. Plot The game takes place sometime later after the events of Skate 2. The main protagonist, who is now known as The Legend, became one of the best skaters. He travels to a coastal town of Port Carventer to take part in a sponsored event but fails. To get to the top again, he has to put up his own team. Gameplay Port Carventer differs a lot from San Vanselona. There are no zones where skating is restricted. The city itself… Read more",
