  "publisher": "Hoplon",
  "description": "Heavy Metal Machines is a free-to-play multiplayer action racing game developed by Hoplon. The game is heavily influenced by the classic Rock n' Roll Racing and more modern titles, such as Rocket League, Twisted Metal and the whole genre of MOBAs. Plot The players are free to choose from several characters to play the game. Each one of them has their own backstory and reasons behind their decision to participate in the event. Gameplay The players control the heavily modified vehicles with guns installed on them. The objective of the game is to steal a bomb, that is… Read more",
