  "name": "Legend of Mysteria RPG",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\",\"Sports\",\"Racing\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"2D\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Anime\",\"Family Friendly\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Captions available\",\"JRPG\",\"Shoot 'Em Up\",\"RPGMaker\",\"RPG Maker\"]",
  "publisher": "EQ Games",
  "description": "Legend of Mysteria RPG is a role-playing game made with PRG Maker, the prequel to Labyronia series developed by Labyrinthine. Story The game takes place in the world of Labyronia. You play as Windir, an air mage who lives in a tower with many other mages. The most powerful of them is a fire mage and headmaster Dinyon. One day Dinyon get murder by a mysterious assassin. The guards quickly catch and kill him, however, right before death, he accuses Windir of arranging the murder. The guards catch you, but you manage to escape the tower. Now… Read more",
