  "publisher": "Supra Games",
  "description": "Instead of writing more about why we think this game is great we decided to let our beta testing community write some comments here. \"What is Supraball? - imagine you're playing fifa, controlling just one player. Okay now imagine that each other player is a real person. Okay now imagine you're in first person, and you have this super awesome cannon with dozens of combinations of spins that fires a yellow ball at 400km/h. Okay now imagine you've fired that into the top corner at that speed - and someone saves it. That is supraball!\" Solomon \"So… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/supraball",
