  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"2D\",\"Horror\",\"Funny\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Comedy\",\"Dark\",\"Point & Click\",\"achievements\",\"Dark Humor\",\"Psychological\"]",
  "publisher": "Daedalic Entertainment",
  "description": "Edna & Harvey: Harvey's New Eyes is a point-and-click adventure made by Daedalic Entertainment. It is the second installment in the self-titled series, preceded by Edna & Harvey: The Breakout released three years prior — in 2008. Both games' setting is the 2D comic world. The game design feature of the game is an absence of bars with the actions, usually to the genre. Gameplay only allows speaking with the other characters, choosing the corresponding emotional reaction (much like a dialogue wheel in Mass Effect series) and connect objects within the… Read more",
