  "publisher": "Bethesda Softworks",
  "description": "Wolfenstein: The New Blood is an FPS game which serves as a prequel to Wolfenstein: The New Order developed by MachineGames. The game is set in the alternate 1946, where Nazi Germany is close to winning World War II. You play as B.J Blaskowicz set out on a secret mission to turn the tides in favor of the Allies. The game is divided into two chapters: Rudi Jäger and the Den of Wolves and The Dark Secrets of Helga Von Schabbs. In the first chapter, you have to escape the prison Blaskowicz was put into after his cover was blown. The second chapter has Blaskowicz infiltrate the fictional city of … Read more",
