  "publisher": "CD PROJEKT RED",
  "description": "Cyberpunk 2077 is a science fiction game loosely based on the role-playing game Cyberpunk 2020. Setting The game is set in the year 2077 in a fictional futuristic metropolis Night City in California. In the world of the game, there are developed cybernetic augmentations that enhance people's strength, agility, and memory. The city is governed by corporations. Many jobs are taken over by the robots, leaving a lot of people poor and homeless. Night City has a roaring underworld, with black markets, underground surgeons, drug dealers, and… Read more",
