  },
  "name": "Mafia: Definitive Edition",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Shooter\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Story Rich\",\"Open World\",\"Third Person\",\"Gore\",\"Classic\",\"Violent\",\"Third-Person Shooter\",\"Sexual Content\",\"Crime\",\"Remake\",\"Driving\",\"first person mod\",\"mafia\"]",
  "publisher": "2K Games",
  "description": "Part one of the Mafia crime saga - 1930s, Lost Heaven, IL Re-made from the ground up, rise through the ranks of the Mafia during the Prohibition era of organized crime. After a run-in with the mob, cab driver Tommy Angelo is thrust into a deadly underworld. Initially uneasy about falling in with the Salieri crime family, Tommy soon finds that the rewards are too big to ignore. Play a Mob Movie: Live the life of a Prohibition-era gangster and rise through the ranks of the Mafia. Lost Heaven, IL: Recreated 1930's cityscape, filled with interwar architecture, cars and culture to see, hear and interact with. Re-Made Classic: Faithfully recreated, with expanded story, gameplay and original score. This is the Mafia you remembered and much more.Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/mafia",
