  "name": "Far Cry 3: Blood Dragon",
  "genre": "[\"Shooter\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Open World\",\"First-Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"FPS\",\"Funny\",\"Comedy\",\"Stealth\",\"Retro\",\"Post-apocalyptic\",\"Futuristic\",\"Cyberpunk\",\"Dragons\",\"1980s\",\"Parody\"]",
  "publisher": "Ubisoft Entertainment",
  "description": "The game uses part of the world Far Cry 3. In 2007, a devastating nuclear war was interrupted by a temporary truce between world powers. But the state without war is not pleasant to everyone - on a remote island someone creates an army of robots called Omega Force, to force the world to resume the war. On the island comes the fighter of the special division Mark IV Cyber ​​Commando, cyborg Rex Power Colt, to prevent the villain to realize his plan. The character moves through the levels, destroys enemies, collects useful items and performs certain tasks.… Read more",
