  },
  "name": "Ascension: Deckbuilding Game",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Card\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"2D\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Sandbox\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Early Access\",\"Retro\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Nudity\",\"Building\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Sexual Content\",\"Online PvP\",\"Top-Down\",\"Management\",\"Linear\",\"Base Building\",\"Drama\",\"PvE\",\"Resource Management\",\"Economy\",\"Demons\",\"Card Game\",\"4X\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Board Game\",\"Mythology\",\"2D Platformer\",\"LGBTQ+\",\"2D-платформер\",\"Real Time Tactics\",\"Strategy RPG\",\"Hex Grid\",\"Precision Platformer\",\"Political Sim\",\"Deck Building\"]",
  "publisher": "Asmodee Digital",
  "description": "Ascension: Chronicle of the Godslayer, was the first officially licensed deck building card game for iOS, and is now available for your PC as Ascension: Deckbuilding Game, complete with 5 full expansion decks! Play alone or with friends to battle against the Fallen One for honor and victory. Conceived and designed by three Magic: the Gathering tournament champions, Ascension will provide hours of engaging and strategic game play for enthusiast and experienced gamers alike. Highlights • Over 300 beautifully detailed cards, hand drawn by Eric Sabee. • Full asynchronous support for multiplayer online games. • Play against multiple A.I. opponents using varied strategies. • Introductory tutorial to teach you how to play.Show less",
