  "name": "Mahjong Soul",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Card\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Multiplayer\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Free to Play\",\"Tactical\",\"PvP\",\"Anime\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"In-App Purchases\",\"Cute\",\"Colorful\",\"Online PvP\",\"Relaxing\",\"character\",\"Card Game\",\"friends\",\"Souls-like\",\"Board Game\",\"Real Time Tactics\",\"fun\",\"tabletop\",\"youtube\",\"Gaming\",\"mahjong\",\"Маджонг\"]",
  "publisher": "YOSTAR",
  "description": "Game Highlights - Exquisite playable ACG characters fully voiced by famous Japanese CVs. - Rich character designs paired with deep character progression and storytelling. - Enticingly cool visual effects, Mahjong can be just as thrilling as fantasy. - A various lineup of items for you to customize! - Mischief and mayhem with your opponents with hilarious character emojis! - The in-game tutorial will allow you to instantly grasp the fun of Mahjong. - Friends system, practice your Mahjong skills together with your friends. - Fair gameplay, with more events and tournaments to come. For the latest on all things Mahjong Soul! Find us here: Mahjong Soul Official Homepage: https://mahjongsoul.yo-star.com/#/ Official Discord Server: https://discord.gg/mahjongsoul Official Twitter Account: https://twitter.com/MahjongSoul_EN Official Facebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/MahjongSoulEN/ Official YouTube Account: https://www.youtube.com/c/MahjongSoulOfficialYostarShow less",
