{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681627"
  },
  "name": "Wars Across The World",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Split Screen\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Historical\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Board Game\"]",
  "publisher": "Plug In Digital",
  "description": "WAW is a unique strategy turn-based game concept, on a boardgame spirit, which aims at simulating in one single system ALL conflicts throughout the world (and beyond) from Prehistoric times to nowadays, from grand massive wars to asymmetrical conflicts. And it will work also on non-historical, alternate history, fantastic or SF titles. The key is the use of a single system of rules and situations which works in all cases. Why? Because we want players to learn rules only once, get confident and at ease with them, and then spend all their time with the titles in the c… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/wars-across-the-world",
