  "name": "Tsuro - The Game of the Path",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Family\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"PvP\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Online PvP\",\"Top-Down\",\"4 Player Local\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Board Game\",\"Remote Play Together\",\"Shared/Split Screen PvP\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"tabletop\",\"Asynchronous Multiplayer\",\"solitaire\"]",
  "publisher": "Thunderbox Entertainment",
  "description": "Create your own journey with Tsuro: The Game of the Path . Place a tile, and slide your stone along the path created... but take care! Other players’ paths can lead you in the wrong direction - or off the board entirely. Paths will cross and connect, and the choices you make affect all the journeys across the board. BEAUTIFUL The intricate artwork of the original board game is brought to life with fluid animation and sparkling pyrotechnics. Every component has been recreated in meticulous detail, including the box! PLAY WITH FRIENDS Tsuro supports up to 8… Read more",
