  "description": "Based on the popular Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D's animated TV series -Includes the latest cards from the official Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D's Trading Card Game -Compete against the most popular Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D’s characters during the finals -Battle through Single player or compete in 4 player tag duels with text and voice chat ability -INCLUDES 3 MODES OF PLAY: RANK MATCH - Compete against Yu-Gi-Oh! fans of the same rank and ability QUICK MATCH- Jump right into the action and compete against any Yu-Gi-Oh! fan CUSTOM MATCH - Battle your friends and completely customize the rules of play C… Read more",
