  "publisher": "Ketchapp",
  "description": "Will you be the first to place all your tiles on the table for a win? Enjoy endless fun with this easy-to-play interface. Play Domino anytime, anywhere against one or three opponents. Mix your opponents between CPU or friends and family in a pass-and-play mode. Explore several options such as different tiles and tables, sixes or nines pips sets, amazing music and more.",
