  },
  "name": "Sophie's Dice",
  "genre": "[\"Simulation\",\"Board Games\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Sophie Houlden",
  "description": "The ultimate 3D dice roller: roll many kinds of virtual dice, and make custom dice suited for almost any game.Features:Select dice from your list, or enter roll expressions using standard dice notationSupport for many roll behaviours such as dropping highest/lowest X dice, explosion, dice pool counting, and moreSave roll expressions you frequently use to easily re-roll themIncludes dice for most table-top RPGs*Easily edit dice to make them your ownIncludes many pre-made dice, over 130 rollable dice shapes, and lots of images/sound effects for all kinds of custom dice.Import image files to display on dice faces, and sound effects they come up.Dice are saved as .xml files which you can share with other people who have Sophie's Dice* d20 system (DnD), Fudge/Fate, Narrative system (Star Wars, Genesys). If your RPG needs some other kind of dice, you can make them pretty easily :)Show less",
