  "publisher": "Telltale Games",
  "description": "NOTE: These games are same-room multiplayer party games. For 1-100 players! Your phones or tablets are your controllers! The team behind YOU DON’T KNOW JACK presents FIVE guffaw-inducing party games in one pack! Games include: The comedy trivia sensation YOU DON’T KNOW JACK 2015 (1-4 players) with hundreds of all-new questions. The hilarious bluffing game Fibbage XL (2-8 players), with over 50% more questions added to the original hit game Fibbage. The bizarre drawing game Drawful (3-8 players) - you draw right there on your phone or tabl… Read more",
