  "publisher": "Asmodee Digital",
  "description": "After a long voyage of great deprivation, your ships have finally reached the coast of an uncharted island. However, other explorers have also landed on Catan: The race to settle the island has begun! Build roads and towns, trade skillfully and become ruler over Catan! Set out on a journey into the Catan universe, and compete in exciting duels against players from all over the world. The board game classic and the Catan card game, with totally new graphics, bring an authentic card table feel to your screen. Play the basic board game in multiplayer, as well as… Read more",
