{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681650"
  },
  "name": "Carcassonne",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Family\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"In-App Purchases\",\"exclusive\",\"city\",\"friends\",\"fun\",\"Solo\",\"Steam Turn Notifications\"]",
  "publisher": "Asmodee Digital",
  "description": "Play the original award winning board game Carcassonne with friends, family, or other board game enthusiasts - online or offline. Includes six expansions! Build a medieval landscape, tile by tile, claim landmarks with your followers and score points. As a winner of the prestigious \"Spiel des Jahres\" award in 2001, the game allows for a plethora of play styles and strategies. If you like social gaming or board games you will love Carcassonne! FEATURES • Cross-platform play with iOS version • Official Carcassonne game with original artwork • Internet multiplayer • Unique Solitaire mode • Includes all expansions released for iOS: • \"The River\" adds a new strategic element to the game play • \"Inns & Cathedrals\" adds a double follower and tiles to upvalue cities and roads. • \"Traders & Builders\" with trade-goods, pigs and builders. • \"Princess & Dragon\" with dragon, princess, fairy and magic portals. • \"Phantom\" adds the phantom, a game piece you can place in addition to other followers. • \"Winter\" with a new theme, tiles, and the Gingerbread Man. • Easy mode that does not count fields, ideal for Kids. • 9 different AI players: Hans, Count, Countess, Maid, Servant, Juggler, Fortune Teller, Witch and Warlock. • Game Center Achievements • Comprehensive in-game manual • Play with Game Center friendsShow less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/carcassonne-2",
