  "name": "Pathfinder Adventures",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Card\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Fantasy\",\"Violent\",\"In-App Purchases\",\"Card Game\",\"Includes Source SDK\",\"Board Game\",\"Steam Turn Notifications\"]",
  "publisher": "Asmodee Digital",
  "description": "Features players experience exclusively in the digital version include: Reactive cutscenes featuring Pathfinder's iconic characters. Explore towns, cities, dungeons, and landscapes of the Rise of the Runelords campaign maps for places like Sandpoint and Thistletop. Beautifully enchanced and animated location backdrops. Multiple Adventure profiles so players can experience the campaign using every character. Play through a tutorial that distills the rulebook down into a small mini-adventure.",
