{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681666"
  },
  "name": "Mahjong Tales: Ancient Wisdom",
  "genre": "[\"Board Games\",\"Puzzle\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Multiplayer\",\"Story\",\"Music\",\"console\",\"match\"]",
  "publisher": "Big Fish Games",
  "description": "Mahjong Tales™: Ancient Wisdom is the first Mahjong game available for PlayStation®Network, offering a narrated story mode that whisks players away into a storybook adventure, revealing hand-illustrated ancient Chinese tales one game at a time. The challenging Motion Mode will test both wit and reflexes as players match the moving tiles, while Infinity Mode allows gamers to choose from numerous classic game layouts and tile sets. Mahjong Tales™ not only delivers a robust feature set with countless levels for both single and multiplayer gameplay, but it also has been meticulously and artistically created to take advantage of the console's high definition capabilities, presented in stunning 1080p. All game modes support deep statistics tracking and rankings and feature trophy support. And with custom music support, you can listen to your favorite tunes throughout your adventure. TikGames, LLC. © 2008-2009, TikGames, LLC. All rights reserved. Creat Studios, Inc. © 2008-2009, Creat Studios, Inc. All rights reserved. All trademarks, trade names and logos are the property of their respective owners. Purchase or use of this item is subject to the PlayStation®Network Terms of Service and User Agreement. This item has been sublicensed to you by Sony Computer Entertainment America.Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/mahjong-tales-ancient-wisdom",
