{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681670"
  },
  "name": "Paperback: The Game (2017)",
  "genre": "[\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Card\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Fowers Games",
  "description": "Word-building meets deck-building in the unique game Paperback. Players start with a deck of letter cards and wild cards. This is like their own bag of ‘scrabble’ tiles. With each hand of cards you make a word and score it. This score is how much money you have to purchase more cards for your deck. Collect cool letters with abilities, such as drawing more cards or double word score. Buy Novel cards to gain ‘fame’ points to win the game! Here's what people have said about the hit boardgame that is in it's fifth print run: \"I've had this game for a month or two now and I honestly believe it to be one of the best games of the year.\" - HeirToPendragon Features: • Online play with up to 4 players • 3 levels of AI opponents • Tons of cool card powers • Classic pulp novel artwork • Win with wordsmithing or power combos - up to you! • Asynchronous multiplayer games with up to 4 players.Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/paperback-the-game-2017",
