  "publisher": "Ubisoft Entertainment",
  "description": "New rules and modifiers will change the way you play Boggle! Bonus Dice allows you to score bigger points with multipliers, but be quick because they won't stay in the same place for long. Time Attack lets you race against the clock! Add more time by adding more words. Word Find gives you words to search for, all you have to do is find them. Banned Letter makes random letters unusable for brief periods of time, and watch out the for the bomb in Minefield which re-rolls all adjacent dice when it explodes! Play Boggle against a friend side by side in a local game, or take your sk… Read more",
