{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa12681674"
  },
  "name": "Bottom of the 9th",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Sports\",\"Board Games\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"stats\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Handelabra Games",
  "description": "Play the most exciting moment of baseball in this fast-paced dice and card game! It’s a beautiful day here at the ballpark, and this game has been a squeaker! Everyone expected the league leaders to roll into town and easily defeat the home team. But the scrappy upstarts have played the game of their lives and managed to keep the score tied right until the end. Their fatigue is showing and now it's their last chance. If the home team batters don’t score a run now, the visitors will be sure to win the game in extra innings. It all comes down to the Bottom of the 9th! Will … Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/bottom-of-the-9th",
