{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4d967c07aa1268167f"
  },
  "name": "Chess",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\",\"Sports\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\",\"Puzzle\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"2D\",\"Free to Play\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"PvP\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Turn-Based Combat\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Noir\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Board Game\",\"Remote Play Together\",\"2D Platformer\",\"2D-платформер\",\"Shared/Split Screen PvP\",\"Logic\",\"Chess\",\"Roguelike Deckbuilder\"]",
  "publisher": "baKno Games",
  "description": "Step into a world where every piece has potential and every move counts. Chess, the game that has enthralled thinkers for over a millennium, is now available for your mobile enjoyment. With Chess: The Grand Strategy Game, transform idle time into an intense strategy session or dive into a family game night with this timeless pursuit. Unleash Your Inner Chess Master Classic Heritage Meets Modern Play: Embrace the rich history of a 6th-century masterpiece as it converges with cutting-edge technology. Our app ensures the essence of chess is preserved and presented for the strategist in everyone. Play Your Way: Whether you're sharpening your skills against our sophisticated AIs or relishing in a match against family and friends, there's always a new challenge waiting. Test your mettle against AIs set from child's play to near-impossible and see if you can claim victory! Elo-Boosting Challenges: Earn experience points and level up your game as you defeat AI opponents. Tackle Easy (+1), Medium (+3), Hard (+5), and Expert (+7) levels to become the ultimate chess champion. Feature-Packed for Chess Aficionados Undo Feature: Made a mistake? No problem! Take a step back with our Undo feature. Board Editor: Customize your battlefield with an intuitive Board Editor. Exquisite Chess Sets: Choose from a variety of custom piece and board styles to suit your aesthetic preference. Game Save/Load: Life calls? Pause and save your game, then load it up anytime to continue your conquest. Multiple AI Difficulties: Hone your skills across 5 levels of AI difficulties – tailor your opponents to match your proficiency. Custom Themes: Personalize your chess experience with custom themes, avatars, and sounds. Timed Games: Craving a speedy match? Set the clock and test your quick-thinking skills with timer-based games. Your Global Chess Community Engage with a community of enthusiasts! Track your progress, share your most triumphant victories, and climb the ranks to prove your strategic prowess. Chess: The Grand Strategy Game is more than just an app – it's a journey through the landscape of one of the world's most venerable games, redesigned for the modern strategist. Download now and let the kings and queens bow to your command!Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/chess",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/82f/82fd11bcce59cfcdb54da09b5eae2f0c.jpg",
