  "name": "Card Dungeon",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Card Game\"]",
  "publisher": "Playtap Games",
  "description": "turn based rogue-like set in a gorgeous board game setting .Card Dungeon Features Turn based gameplay rich with choices and opportunities to screw up and die. Face hard choices about which of the 1000’s of cards you find you will want to keep and which to discard. Don't get too attached to any of the cards as they deteriorate with use and will need to be replaced! Save the soul of the lands and crush the hordes of the Nethermist! Fight 40+ enemies each with their own unique skill cards that they will use to end your short life. Learn their strategies through … Read more",
