  "name": "SimLife",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Educational\",\"Family\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Maxis",
  "description": "SimLife is virtual life simulator game. Customize your character, choose your hobbies, skills and lifestyle.If you like simulation games, SimLife - virtual life simulator is for you. You can customize your character, choose your horoscope, choose your personality, choose your hobbies and lifestyle.Do you interesting art or business? You can customize all your character. You can build and design your dream life and try to keep alive. Hungry, energy, fun, social and culture you have to be careful if you want to keep alive.Your life adventure is starting, build your dream house, customize your character, choose entrepreneur and find a job and experience to the business life, grown your business and become a CEO of your company or you can choose artist and become a fashion stylist or fashion brand owner. You can reject all traditional jobs and you can start your career with SimTuber, eSport Gamer, Blogger, Developer and more. • Advanced character customization system.• Personality characteristics customization.• Amazing 3D graphics, beautiful houses, items, characters.• Simple touch-to-move system and nice gameplay.• Advanced camera control system. Rotate, drag and zoom.• Funny mini games.Show less",
