  "name": "Eclipse: New Dawn for the Galaxy",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Space\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"4X\",\"Board Game\",\"Asynchronous Multiplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Big Daddy's Creations, Wspolnik",
  "description": "AN ADAPTATION OF A CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED BOARD GAME Background Alliances are shattering, and hasty diplomatic treaties are made in secrecy. A confrontation of the superpowers seems inevitable – only the outcome of the galactic conflict remains to be seen. Which faction will emerge victorious and rule the galaxy? Gameplay Eclipse places you in control of a vast interstellar civilization, competing for success with its rivals. But instead of overcomplex set of rules and overall epicness, it offers more accessible choices, more elegant mechanics and much faster gameplay.… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/eclipse-new-dawn-for-the-galaxy",
