  },
  "name": "Hold the Line: The American Revolution",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Board Games\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "HexWar Games",
  "description": "Hold the Line covers battles fought during the American Revolution. This game is a careful conversion of the board game of the same name developed by Worthington Publishing. Jump in and take command of the American or British forces during this pivotal moment in the history of nations! Featuring an addictive “Action Point” system, you have a limited number of orders to dictate to your troops each turn. You must decide where to attack, who to rally, where to move and who to sacrifice to achieve your goals. Each scenario features unique objectives for… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/hold-the-line-the-american-revolution",
