  "name": "Backgammon Blitz",
  "genre": "[\"Board Games\",\"Casual\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Board Game\",\"Steam Turn Notifications\"]",
  "publisher": "Nomad Games",
  "description": "Backgammon's back... with a bang! Loved by millions, played for centuries, backgammon is a two-player strategy game quite unlike any other. The goal is simple: race to get your checkers off the board first. The deceptively deep rules and rhythm of backgammon has secured it as a favorite among casual and veteran players alike. Whether in single, local, online, multiplayer or blasting through the madness of Blitz mode: one taste and you'll be hooked. Rendered in a gorgeous style - harnessing cutting-edge technology - this version of backgammon isn't merely a… Read more",
