  "name": "PewDiePie's Tuber Simulator",
  "genre": "[\"Simulation\",\"Board Games\",\"Casual\"]",
  "tags": "[\"online\",\"Music\",\"Epic\",\"room\",\"simulator\"]",
  "publisher": "Outerminds",
  "description": "Follow in the footsteps of one of the biggest internet stars, PewDiePie, by creating your very own pocket Tuber in PewDiePie's Tuber Simulator! Will you become the biggest, baddest Tuber ever in no time and kick PewDiePie out of his own throne? Find out in this 2.5D isometric retro styled game! ⋆ MAKE VIDEOS and GAIN VIEWS and SUBS to buy new ITEMS such as EQUIPMENT, FURNITURE, CLOTHES and even PETS! ⋆ REAL VOICE ACTING by PewDiePie himself! ⋆ COMPLETE EPIC QUESTS to gain currency quickly! ⋆ SHOW OFF YOUR AWESOME ROOM by sharing it… Read more",
