  "name": "Hasbro Family Game Night",
  "genre": "[\"Arcade\",\"Board Games\"]",
  "tags": "[\"board-games\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Take your favorite Hasbro games with you! With five different games to enjoy, and MR. POTATO HEAD as your charming host, FAMILY GAME NIGHT is hours of fun, whether you play on your own or with a friend! You can even create and customize your own play area by unlocking trophies and avatars. With FAMILY GAME NIGHT, you are guaranteed to have a good time no matter where you are! Features • Play classic and all-new versions of your favorite Hasbro games, including: o BATTLESHIP o CONNECT 4 o OPERATION… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/hasbro-family-game-night",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/161/161de415e8e0cbab24a6ab91b502087d.jpg",
