  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Early Access\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\"]",
  "publisher": "Temple Gates Games",
  "description": "One-hundred years ago, The Infinity Engine was shattered and its reality-bending shards have destroyed most of the world. Now, it falls upon you to gather your forces, defeat your adversaries, and rebuild the Infinity Engine! Will you survive? Shards of Infinity is the follow-up to the award winning deckbuilding game, Ascension. Build your armies by recruiting allies and champions from four unique factions. Launch surprise attacks on your foes by instantly deploying mercenaries. Unlock limitless power by mastering the Shard of Infinity. App Features: - For… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/shards-of-infinity",
