  "tags": "[\"online\",\"battle\",\"friends\",\"Trading\",\"match\",\"duel\"]",
  "publisher": "Konami",
  "description": "Duel Yu-Gi-Oh! characters from the past and present and others online!- Includes the latest cards from the official Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game.- Compete against the popular characters from Yu-Gi-Oh!, Yu-Gi-Oh! GX, Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D's, and Yu-Gi-Oh! ZEXAL.- Battle through Single Player or compete in 4 player tag duels with text and voice chat ability.ONLINE PLAY INCLUDES 3 MODES: RANK MATCH - Compete against Yu-Gi-Oh! fans of the same rank and ability. QUICK MATCH - Jump right in the action and compete against any Yu-Gi-Oh! fan. CUSTOM MATCH - Battle your friends and completely customize the rules of play.1 player106KB minimum save sizeHDTV screen resolution: 720pDUALSHOCK®3Network FeaturesNetwork Players 2-4 This item is being licensed or sublicensed to you by Sony Computer Entertainment America and is subject to the Network Terms of Service and User Agreement, this item’s use restrictions and other applicable terms located at www.us.playstation.com/support/useragreements. If you do not wish to accept all these terms, do not download this item. This item may be used with up to 2 activated PlayStation®3 systems associated with this Sony Entertainment Network account. Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/yu-gi-oh-millennium-duels",
