  "name": "YANKAI'S PEAK.",
  "genre": "[\"Board Games\",\"Indie\",\"Puzzle\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\"]",
  "publisher": "Kenny Sun",
  "description": "YANKAI'S PEAK. is a love letter to PYRAMIDS . A colorful PYRAMID -pushing puzzle game about the beauty and joy of being a sentient blue PYRAMID . Pretty cool gameplay. Over 130 handcrafted levels. 7 PARTs each exploring a unique multifaceted mechanic. Meditative sound design. A sick intro. A game by Kenny Sun. Music by JACK+JIM. (YANKAI is pronounced YEN - KYE).",
