{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4e967c07aa1268170a"
  },
  "name": "Deus Ex Remastered",
  "genre": "[\"Action Games\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Action\",\"Conspiracy\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\",\"Old School\",\"Dystopian\",\"Cyberpunk\",\"Immersive Sim\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Futuristic\",\"Noir\",\"Dark\",\"Action RPG\",\"FPS\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"3D\",\"1990's\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"Drama\",\"Lore-Rich\"]",
  "publisher": "Aspyr",
  "description": "Question Everything. Trust No One. This is Deus Ex Remastered – the definitive version of Ion Storm’s legendary cyberpunk immersive sim, modernized with visual upgrades, modern enhancements, and quality-of-life improvements for a new generation of operatives. The year is 2052. Societies are teetering on collapse, plagues spread unchecked, and shadow governments shape the future. You are JC Denton—a nano-augmented UNATCO operative tasked with protecting order. But the deeper you dig, the more lies you uncover. What begins as a mission becomes a fracture point in human history. Wander through post-crash New York, uncover secrets in Hong Kong’s back alleys, infiltrate bunkers under Paris, and dig through the depths of Area 51. Every location has new visual fidelity while maintaining the same dystopian tension and conspiratorial paranoia that made the original game so iconic. Breach locked systems. Hack firewalls. Cloak and vanish. Every level, every mission, every outcome can be rewritten with your chosen nano-augmentations. No run plays the same. No choice is without consequence. Reimagined lighting, dynamic shadows, water physics, particle effects, and fully updated textures breathe new life into the dystopia. Brand-new character models with smoother lip-sync animations and ragdoll physics to complete the transformation Quality-of-Life Enhancements: Autosaves, faster loading, achievement tracking, and cloud saves across supported platforms. Controller Support: Refined radial menus, fluid weapon management, and streamlined navigation, all adapted for modern controllers. Multi-Screen Support: 4K-ready UI, ultrawide and multi-monitor display support.",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3131640/Deus_Ex_Remastered?snr=1_49_4_1642_salesmarttrendingwishlisted",
  "image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131640/7e9cb052661cba74ea10edcbf588da898b469654/header.jpg?t=1759276584",
