{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4e967c07aa12681711"
  },
  "name": "Dead as Disco Demo",
  "genre": "[\"Action Games\",\"Action\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Action\",\"Beat 'em up\",\"Rhythm\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"Spectacle fighter\",\"Colorful\",\"Anime\",\"Stylized\",\"Third Person\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Cyberpunk\",\"Futuristic\",\"Martial Arts\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Combat\",\"Controller\",\"Score Attack\",\"Singleplayer\",\"Character Action Game\"]",
  "publisher": "Brain Jar Games, Inc.",
  "description": "Dead as Disco puts you in the shoes of Charlie Disco, a fallen icon with one chance to reclaim the spotlight from the Idols – Charlie’s ex-bandmates and musical legends. Confront the Idols in stylish combat that syncs to every song, and survive a world torn apart by music, fame, and betrayal In this action-packed, literal Beat ‘Em Up.The Dead as Disco Demo includes the following game content Tutorial, Learn the basics on Beat Kune Do where music meets melee! Sample Story Mission, Face off against the Idol Hemlock at his underground concert deep in the subways that run below the city streets. Infinite Disco, Test your skill and go infinite in a wave based combat arena 11 Songs, rock out to a sample of our original music library and licensed tracks from Monstercat Play your own music, Bust skulls to your favorite Jams! Play songs (MP3) from your own music library inside Infinite Disco to create custom experiences. Global & Friend Leaderboards, compete against your friends or the world and see if you can claim the Next Fest crown! Unlock even more exciting content and features in the full game!",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3763830/Dead_as_Disco_Demo?snr=1_49_4_1642_7007",
  "image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/24190d481870bd662a19557192c029e9bb4052fe/header.jpg?t=1755729285",
