  "publisher": "HaHaHaGame",
  "description": "Your wife is a desktop pet game. Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, and zooming in and out. Drag with the left mouse button and use the scroll wheel to zoom in and out during the drag process. Dual screen players can switch the screen where their wife is located by using the win key, shift key, and left/right keys. The game includes a cute desktop pet character.",
