  "name": "Planet Zoo",
  "genre": "[\"Simulation Games\",\"Casual\",\"Simulation\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Management\",\"Simulation\",\"Building\",\"Sandbox\",\"Nature\",\"City Builder\",\"Economy\",\"Realistic\",\"Singleplayer\",\"Family Friendly\",\"Cute\",\"Resource Management\",\"Strategy\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Relaxing\",\"Open World\",\"Casual\",\"Funny\",\"Horses\"]",
  "publisher": "Frontier Developments",
  "description": "Build a world for wildlife in Planet Zoo. From the developers of Planet Coaster and Zoo Tycoon comes the ultimate zoo sim. Construct detailed habitats, manage your zoo, and meet authentic living animals who think, feel and explore the world you create around them.",
