  "name": "Primordialis",
  "genre": "[\"Simulation Games\",\"Action\",\"Indie\",\"Simulation\",\"Early Access\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Early Access\",\"Simulation\",\"Physics\",\"Action Roguelike\",\"Exploration\",\"Nature\",\"Roguelike\",\"Sandbox\",\"Roguelite\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Difficult\",\"Underwater\",\"Indie\",\"Building\",\"2D\",\"Survival\",\"Top-Down\",\"Procedural Generation\",\"Strategy\",\"Perma Death\"]",
  "publisher": "Kyler Natividad",
  "description": "Primordialis is a physics-based roguelike fish builder. Unleash your creativity to defeat creatures using venomous tentacles, electrical shocks, or exploding children. The possibilities are endless. Explore the primordial depths to reveal its secrets and discover what lies beyond. ================================= Create ================================== ================================= Survive =================================",
