{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4e967c07aa1268174d"
  },
  "name": "Coal LLC Demo",
  "genre": "[\"Action Games\",\"Action\",\"Simulation\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Simulation\",\"Strategy\",\"Roguelike\",\"Mining\",\"Roguelite\",\"Time Management\",\"Capitalism\",\"2D\",\"Colorful\",\"Cute\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Economy\",\"Lemmings\",\"Management\",\"2D Platformer\",\"Collectathon\",\"Character Customization\",\"Physics\",\"Procedural Generation\",\"Resource Management\"]",
  "publisher": "Bye Bye Ocean",
  "description": "With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fulfil your coal quota each day. Or else. The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and hyper-realistic methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however. Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into several hundreds of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause. Do you have what it takes to build the greatest coal mining operation of all time?",
  "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3451610/Coal_LLC_Demo?snr=1_241_4_nature_7007",
  "image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451610/464a07362fbcfc902988b469725e65e049d7260d/header.jpg?t=1757590470",
