  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Become the ultimate icon of today’s urban car culture in Need for Speed™, featuring Five Ways to Play and a huge open world to race and explore from dusk ‘till dawn. FIVE WAYS TO PLAY – Earn reputation and master all Five Ways to Play - Speed, Style, Build, Crew and Outlaw - to win your own way. RICH, AUTHENTIC CUSTOMIZATION – Customize your car and express your style with extensive visual modifications, performance upgrades and handling tuned to your specification. REAL WORLD ICONS - Get inspired by the icons of today's urban car scene - Magnus Walker, Ken Block, Nakai-S… Read more",
