  "publisher": "Deep Silver",
  "description": "ONRUSH is a new breed of high-impact, adrenaline fuelled off-road arcade racing! It’s about speed, takedowns and teamwork with high-tempo thrills that focus on fun, excitement and the spectacular. TAKEDOWNS Takedowns are core to ONRUSH. Speed off cliff edges and traverse huge ramps flying hundreds of feet through the bold, bright sky. Land with immense force crushing any opposing team vehicles unfortunate enough to be below. RUSH Boosting at breakneck speed only gets you so far. To really gain an unworldly edge, unleash the … Read more",
