  "name": "Street Racing Syndicate",
  "genre": "[\"Racing\",\"Arcade\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Open World\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Classic\",\"Split Screen\",\"Nudity\",\"Driving\"]",
  "publisher": "Funbox Media",
  "description": "Street Racing Syndicate is a game about underground street racing. The player's goal is not only to win races, but also to become famous and attract girls. Modes Street Racing Syndicate offers a variety of modes. Street Mode is the traditional career option. The player starts as a newcomer who was hired by a sponsor to win a race. Victories grant the player money to purchase better cars. There are also Roll Up Races, in which a random car challenges the player to a race. Another type of races is Respect Challenges, in which the player has to earn respect to attract women. There… Read more",
