  "publisher": "Codemasters",
  "description": "GRID 2 is a racing game, the sequel to Race Driver: GRID. In the centre of the \"story\" GRID 2 is a racing championship, which we gradually promote around the world. Money is not needed, the main thing is to conquer the audience. The race will be held in such places as Paris, Hong Kong, Chicago, Dubai, etc. All the tracks, drivers, teams, cars and sponsors in the game are real. Compared to GRID (the first part of the series), there are more modes. There were races on the so-called \"Checkpoint\", endurance race and other several options. And the significant… Read more",
