  "publisher": "Disney Interactive",
  "description": "Split/Second is a racing game with an accent on the destructible environment and the game within a game mechanics. Gameplay The title features usual for the genre lap and sprint races, but the unique feature lies in the destructible environment. Unlike previous installments, utilizing such mechanics, in Split/Second the player must fill the \"power play\" bar and unleash its power on the nearby construction — for example, crush the water boiler when there are opponents underneath it. The strength of the effect depends on how full the power bar is —… Read more",
