  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Sandbox\",\"Free to Play\",\"stats\",\"Includes level editor\",\"Moddable\",\"Realistic\",\"Crafting\",\"Physics\",\"Building\",\"Management\",\"Driving\",\"Education\"]",
  "publisher": "PlayWay",
  "description": "The Bestselling Car Mechanic Simulator series goes to a new level! Car Mechanic Simulator 2018 challenges players to repair, paint, tune and drive cars. Find classic, unique cars in the new Barn Find module and Junkyard module. You can even add your self-made car in the Car Editor. Build and expand your repair service empire in this incredibly detailed and highly realistic simulation game, where attention to car detail is astonishing. All this with new, photorealistic graphics. Featuring more cars (40+), more tools (10+), more options and more parts (1000+) than ever before. It’s … Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/car-mechanic-simulator-2018",
