  "name": "Driver San Francisco",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Racing\",\"Arcade\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Multiplayer\",\"Crime\",\"character\",\"city\",\"Thriller\",\"police\",\"Movie\",\"car\"]",
  "publisher": "Ubisoft Entertainment",
  "description": "Driver: San Francisco is the fifth game in the Driver franchise. It is a game about chases with a crime thriller plot. Plot Plotwise, Driver: San Francisco serves as a sequel to Driver 3 rather than the previous installment, Driver: Parallel Lines. As with the rest of the Driver series, the main character is John Tanner, a police detective, and a talented driver. Tanner is chasing the mobster Charles Jericho who survived the events of Driver 3. While awaiting trial in San Francisco, Jericho escapes the custody and wrecks chaos in the city. Tanner is injured and falls into… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/driver-san-francisco",
