  "publisher": "Konami",
  "description": "Silent Hill: Origins is an action game developed by Climax UK. It was originally released in 2007. It was published by Konami. Silent Hill: Origins has a Metascore of 78, based on professional reviews. Most rawgers rated the game as \"Recommended\". You can play Silent Hill: Origins on PSP and PlayStation 2. Akira Yamaoka and Mark Simmons produced the game. It was directed by Mark Simmons and Sam Barlow. Akira Yamaoka scored the game.",
