  "name": "Eclipsium",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Atmospheric\",\"First-Person\",\"Horror\",\"Exploration\",\"Pixel Graphics\",\"Dark\",\"Retro\",\"Mystery\",\"3D\",\"Walking Simulator\",\"Surreal\",\"Stylized\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Lovecraftian\",\"Silent Protagonist\",\"Thriller\",\"Psychedelic\",\"FMV\",\"FMV-игра\"]",
  "publisher": "CRITICAL REFLEX",
  "description": "Eclipsium is a first-person horror game where you play as the desperate Wanderer. In search of Her, his path leads through hellish tombs, cathedrals of flesh and even through space, immolating himself and sacrificing anything to achieve his goal. Don’t stop There is no safety or comfort in Eclipsium. Let the pale light guide you through, as every place hides its own path to escape. Enter the spiral Everything fades and senses dull in this endless darkness. But with you remains your power - a twisting, transmuting hand, ready to carve a way through whatever stands before you. F… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/eclipsium",
