  "name": "Dungeons & Dragons Neverwinter Nights 2: Enhanced Edition",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Action RPG\",\"Steam Workshop\",\"PvP\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Includes level editor\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"combat\",\"Medieval\",\"Magic\",\"Online PvP\",\"Dungeon Crawler\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Party-Based RPG\",\"Dungeons & Dragons\"]",
  "publisher": "Aspyr",
  "description": "The Fate of The Forgotten Realms is in Your Hands Return to the city of Neverwinter in Dungeons & Dragons Neverwinter Nights 2: Enhanced Edition. A dark force sweeps over Faerûn, ravaging everything in its path as though searching for something – something that you now find in your possession. As the Shard-Bearer, only you can stop the King of Shadows and his army from desecrating the land you call home. Will you save Faerûn, or fall victim to the temptation of absolute power? When your actions dictate the fate of the Realms, there are no small choices. Incl… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/dungeons-dragons-neverwinter-nights-2-enhanced-edi",
