  "name": "Dragon’s Dogma 2",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Open World\",\"Third Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Action RPG\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"Physics\",\"Medieval\",\"Magic\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"PvE\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Dragons\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Swordplay\",\"Artificial Intelligence\",\"HDR available\"]",
  "publisher": "Capcom",
  "description": "The story begins in an underground gaol where the Dragon's voice echoes in the fog of lost memories. Ascend, Arisen, and best me, in accordance with the dogma of this world. Betwixt the domains of human and beastren, A hero must fulfill their forgotten destiny. What dogma does your heart see through your eyes? ‘Tis a tale of one who shall slay the Dragon and claim the throne.",
