  "name": "Banishers: Ghosts of New Eden",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Action RPG\",\"Choices Matter\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Cinematic\",\"combat\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"Narration\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Emotional\",\"Supernatural\",\"Vampire\"]",
  "publisher": "Focus Entertainment",
  "description": "New Eden, 1695. Antea Duarte and Red mac Raith are lovers and Banishers, ghost-hunters who vowed to protect the living from the threat of lingering ghosts and specters. Following a disastrous last mission, Antea is fatally wounded, becoming one of the spirits she loathes. In the haunted wilds of North America, the couple desperately searches for a way to liberate Antea from her new plight. Immerse yourself in a beautiful, intimate and powerful story between two fated lovers. As Banishers, enter the lives of New Eden’s communities and solve haunting cases in a mystical, lore-rich world plagued with supe… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/banishers-ghosts-of-new-eden",
