{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4e967c07aa126817ef"
  },
  "name": "Buckshot Roulette",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"First-Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Horror\",\"FPS\",\"Dark\",\"3D\",\"Roguelike\",\"Roguelite\",\"Surreal\",\"Blood\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Psychological\",\"Experimental\",\"Gambling\"]",
  "publisher": "CRITICAL REFLEX",
  "description": "BUCKSHOT ROULETTE is a tabletop horror game that attempts to re-design the infamous game of Russian Roulette, replacing the traditional revolver with a proper 12-gauge pump-action shotgun. This extra firepower, and more importantly the different mechanics in handling a shotgun compared to a revolver, offers a fresh take on the classic and deadly game of chance. The game takes place at the top of an underground nightclub, where the metal railings tremble to the pulse of long lost drum machines. A crooked AI dealer is waiting for you. Will you meet them? FEATURES: 15 to 20 minute playthrough. Immersive & grounded tabletop gameplay, featuring diegetic systems and minimal UI. Unscripted rounds that offer unpredictable yet controllable outcomes, with a fair amount of replay value. A ruthless yet fair AI, that makes decisions based on what's on the table, rather than under it. SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS: Relatively modern dedicated graphics card (Vulkan support required) Show less",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/buckshot-roulette",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/fdf/fdfeaffbe45ecab2b2eca5b058432989.jpg",
