  "name": "Metaphor: ReFantazio",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action RPG\",\"Anime\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"Colorful\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"JRPG\",\"Turn-Based Combat\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Choose Your Own Adventure\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Party-Based RPG\",\"Strategy RPG\",\"Time Management\"]",
  "publisher": "SEGA",
  "description": "\"Write your destiny and rise above fear as you step into a fantasy world unlike anything you’ve seen before. Fraught with unsettling mystery, the kingdom stands on a precipice. Now, you must embark on a journey, overcoming obstacles and forging bonds with friends. From the creative minds of the Persona series—Metaphor: ReFantazio marks ATLUS’ first ever, full-scale fantasy RPG, brought to you by director Katsura Hashino, character designer Shigenori Soejima, and composer Shoji Meguro. Metaphor: Refantazio is developed by Studio Zero.\"",
