  "name": "The Thaumaturge",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Fantasy\",\"Exploration\",\"Dark\",\"role-playing\",\"Mystery\",\"Choices Matter\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"combat\",\"Isometric\",\"Magic\",\"Crime\",\"Story\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"Detective\",\"Turn-Based Combat\",\"character\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Demons\",\"city\",\"party\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Psychological\",\"nature\",\"Investigation\",\"Dreams\",\"Creature Collector\",\"learn\",\"characters\",\"choices\",\"skills\",\"shape\",\"spirit\",\"coin\"]",
  "publisher": "11 bit studios",
  "description": "The Thaumaturge is an isometric, story-rich RPG with a unique take on tactical combat, character development features, and investigation mechanics, facing you with morally ambiguous choices – set in a world teeming with mysterious powers and strange ethereal beings called Salutors. The year is 1905. Warsaw lives under the yoke of imperial Russian tsardom. Its inhabitants constitute a diverse group of different ancestries, views, and beliefs with often conflicting interests: Russian soldiers, Jewish merchants, Polish townspeople, and more. Despite the circumstances, … Read more",
