  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Fantasy\",\"Difficult\",\"Violent\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Action RPG\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"3D\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"combat\",\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Souls-like\",\"Mythology\"]",
  "publisher": "Game Science",
  "description": "• Explore a Land of Vast Wonders \"A world unseen, where wonders gleam, And with each stride, a new scene streams.\" Enter a fascinating realm filled with the wonders and discoveries of ancient Chinese mythology! As the Destined One, you shall traverse an array of breathtaking and distinctive landscapes from the classic tale, composing an epic of adventure that is seen anew. • Confront Mighty Foes, Old and New \"Heroic Monkey, might and fame, Adversaries rise, to test his name.\" One of the major highlights of Journey to the West is… Read more",
