  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Strategy\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Survival\",\"Violent\",\"Early Access\",\"Medieval\",\"RTS\",\"Tower Defense\",\"City Builder\"]",
  "publisher": "Door 407",
  "description": "In the RTS-game “Diplomacy is Not an Option”, you will become a medieval feudal lord in a midlife crisis. Due to your position, you must constantly make hundreds of decisions a day related with city- management and economic development. You are tired of this monotonous and, so it seems, meaningless existence. But things are about to change: hordes of bloodlusted enemies, zounds of scary monsters and crowds of rebellious peasants at any second can bring some life to your working schedule.War-time lawsThe country is… Read more",
