  "name": "Unknown 9: Awakening",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Horror\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Stealth\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Mystery\",\"3D\",\"Realistic\",\"Cinematic\",\"combat\",\"Linear\",\"Narration\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Emotional\",\"Alternate History\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Politics\"]",
  "publisher": "Bandai Namco Entertainment",
  "description": "Raised on the streets of Kolkata India and haunted by visions of her own death, Haroona struggles to understand her mysterious innate abilities to manipulate the unseen. A mentor soon helps Haroona hone her gifts, teaches her to access the mysterious hidden dimension known as The Fold and propels her on a journey to unlock the mysteries of this new realm",
