  "name": "Dragon Age: The Veilguard",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action RPG\",\"Character Customization\",\"Choices Matter\",\"Magic\",\"Multiple Endings\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Romance\",\"Lore-Rich\",\"Dragons\",\"CRPG\",\"Family Sharing\",\"LGBTQ+\",\"Remote Play on TV\",\"Politics\",\"Романтика\",\"HDR available\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Enter the world of Thedas, a vibrant land of rugged wilderness, treacherous labyrinths, and glittering cities – steeped in conflict and secret magics. Now, a pair of corrupt ancient gods have broken free from centuries of darkness and are hellbent on destroying the world. Thedas needs someone they can count on. Rise as Rook, Dragon Age’s newest hero. Be who you want to be and play how you want to play as you fight to stop the gods from blighting the world. But you can’t do this alone – the odds are stacked against you. Lead a team of seven companions, each with their own rich… Read more",
