  "publisher": "CD PROJEKT RED",
  "description": "The Witcher 3 REDkit is a modding tool from CD PROJEKT RED and Yigsoft that allows you to customize and expand The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt in ways never seen before. This powerful tool offers advanced features and unparalleled flexibility, enabling you to unleash your creativity by crafting new quests, characters, animations, and more. Unleash your creative spirit to bring your own unique Witcher experience to life and share it with the world. Whether you're a seasoned developer or just starting out, The Witcher 3 REDkit offers exciting opportunities … Read more",
