  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"First-Person\",\"FPS\",\"Funny\",\"Gore\",\"Difficult\",\"Comedy\",\"Violent\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"combat\",\"Fast-Paced\",\"Cartoony\",\"city\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Soundtrack\",\"weapons\",\"secrets\",\"Psychedelic\",\"collection\",\"shoot\",\"learn\",\"crash\",\"7dfps\",\"boomer shooter\",\"human\"]",
  "publisher": "Devolver Digital",
  "description": "Anger Foot is a lightning-fast hard bass blast of kicking doors and kicking ass. Crash through the caffeine-fueled fever dream of Shit City, putting the boot to a menacing menagerie of merciless gangsters. Unleash the world's deadliest feet on a colorful cast of anthropomorphic enemies. Clearing out slums, sewers, and skyscrapers as you grab new weapons, unlock new sneakers, and upgrade your powers in absurd and wonderful ways. Kick and shoot your way to the exit as you leave behind a smoldering trail of shattered doors, broken bones, and crumpled… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/anger-foot",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/da9/da93ffb65843f39b240ffd97c07a3acb.jpg",
