  },
  "name": "Life is Strange: Double Exposure",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Story Rich\",\"Third Person\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Mystery\",\"Choices Matter\",\"Cinematic\",\"Multiple Endings\",\"Steam Trading Cards\",\"Stylized\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Emotional\",\"Choose Your Own Adventure\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Supernatural\",\"Family Sharing\",\"LGBTQ+\",\"Narrative\",\"Романтика\"]",
  "publisher": "Square Enix",
  "description": "Max Caulfield, photographer-in-residence at the prestigious Caledon University, discovers her closest new friend, Safi, dead in the snow. Murdered. To save her, Max tries to Rewind time - a power she’s not used in years... instead, Max opens the way to a parallel timeline where Safi is still alive, and still in danger! Max realizes the killer will soon strike again - in both versions of reality. With her new power to Shift between two timelines - can Max solve and prevent the same murder?",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/life-is-strange-double-exposure",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/279/279a4377b3499615155908764e297e1c.jpg",
