  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Open World\",\"2D\",\"Funny\",\"Exploration\",\"Comedy\",\"Short\",\"Colorful\",\"Cinematic\",\"Side Scroller\",\"Hand-drawn\",\"puzzles\",\"Cartoony\",\"Cartoon\",\"Family Sharing\",\"2D Platformer\",\"2D-платформер\",\"Puzzle Platformer\",\"platformers\",\"indie\",\"adventure-games\"]",
  "publisher": "Panic",
  "description": "Thank Goodness You're Here! is an absurd comedy slapformer set in the bizarre Northern English town of Barnsworth. As a traveling salesman, take the time to see the sights and meet the locals, who are very eager to give you a series of increasingly odd jobs…",
