  },
  "name": "LASERS",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Racing\",\"Massively Multiplayer\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Third Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Horror\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Gore\",\"Free to Play\",\"Controller\",\"PvP\",\"In-App Purchases\",\"Character Customization\",\"Realistic\",\"Parkour\",\"Online PvP\",\"Blood\",\"3D Platformer\",\"Battle Royale\",\"Party Game\"]",
  "publisher": "Straight Back Games",
  "description": "LASERS is a free multiplayer game about surviving deadly laser mazes. Only one player can win. Will it be you? Features Dodge lasers or die trying. One wrong step will cost you your limbs Online multiplayer for 1-10 players Race against the clock to be the last player standing Over 20 handmade levels to beat Full of thick gym bros and girls to play as Unlock emotes and outfits by increasing your Halo Rank Dark, pounding synth music This game was created for fun by a tiny indie studio. If you enjoy it, please show us your support and we'll continue to work on… Read more",
