  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Open World\",\"Third Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Stealth\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"Post-apocalyptic\",\"Crafting\",\"combat\",\"Futuristic\",\"Emotional\",\"Протагонистка\",\"Family Sharing\",\"nature\",\"Mechs\",\"Inventory Management\",\"Постапокалипсис\",\"Artificial Intelligence\"]",
  "publisher": "Sony Interactive Entertainment",
  "description": "Horizon Zero Dawn Remastered is an action, shooter, adventure and RPG game developed by Guerrilla Games and Nixxes software. It was originally released in 2024. It was published by PlayStation PC. Most rawgers rated the game as \"Exceptional\". You can play Horizon Zero Dawn Remastered on PC and PlayStation 5. You can purchase the game on PlayStation Store and Steam. It was produced by Lambert Wolterbeek Muller. It was directed by Mathijs de Jonge. Alexis Smith, Joe Henson, Jonathan Williams and Joris de Man scored the game.",
