  "name": "Sneak Out",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Strategy\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"2D\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Funny\",\"Survival\",\"Comedy\",\"Free to Play\",\"Stealth\",\"Controller\",\"PvP\",\"Family Friendly\",\"Cute\",\"3D\",\"Colorful\",\"Online PvP\",\"Cartoony\",\"Cartoon\",\"Dog\",\"Social Deduction\"]",
  "publisher": "anikataylor",
  "description": "Sneak Out is a crazy free to play multiplayer game of hide and seek full of mischief, pranks, and fun for up to six players. You enter the Haunted Castle with your five friends, and one of you gets randomly chosen as the Hunter. The remaining players must hide and survive within the Castle, completing tasks and avoiding the Hunter until the escape portal opens. Those unlucky penguins who get caught can still assist their friends as Ghost, messing with their pursuers. And those who become Hunters must do everything to stop ‘em all from escaping. Simple, right? Like… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/sneak-out-3",
