  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"First-Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Horror\",\"FPS\",\"Gore\",\"Violent\",\"Early Access\",\"Dark\",\"Retro\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"combat\",\"Story\",\"Stylized\",\"Destruction\",\"Cartoony\",\"character\",\"Soundtrack\",\"Lovecraftian\",\"weapons\",\"Psychedelic\",\"Old School\",\"journey\",\"balance\",\"ancient\",\"sequel\",\"sprites\",\"enemies\",\"lovecraft\",\"book\",\"perspective\",\"design\",\"madness\",\"guitar\",\"soul\",\"effects\"]",
  "publisher": "Fulqrum Publishing",
  "description": "Journey once again into a malevolent world inspired by H.P Lovecraft’s myths where madness awaits on every corner. Embark on a path to salvation as you continue the story of the Priest character from the first installment. How long can you balance on the edge of sanity? Will your sins be forgiven, or your soul consumed by madness? Distinctive dark comic-like visuals Dark hand-drawn graphic design where every frame looks like a page from a comic book is one of the pillars of Forgive Me Father, and the sequel brings a fresh perspective to its unique style… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/forgive-me-father-2",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/a70/a70fcc87baa9d576bb00b7ebd5e50161.jpg",
