  "name": "Command & Conquer Red Alert , Counterstrike and The Aftermath",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"RPG\",\"RTS\",\"Family Sharing\",\"Action RTS\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "Command & Conquer Red Alert pushed the envelope for the RTS genre in the mid-1990s and became one of the most iconic strategy games of all time. Command & Conquer: Red Alert gives you the opportunity to be more devious, cunning, and ruthless than ever before. Red Alert puts the fate of the world in your hands!Counterstrike, the exciting expansion pack to Red Alert, is full of clandestine activity, experimental technologies, and disavowed tactics. Includes 16 all-new missions, where you decide the ultimate fate of the struggle between the Allies and Soviets.In The Aftermath expansion pack, prepare for guerilla tactics, insidious strategies, and forbidden weapons. Includes 18 all-new missions and multiple units in a showdown that will test your mettle.Show less",
