  "name": "Expeditions: A MudRunner Game",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Racing\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Open World\",\"Exploration\",\"Moddable\",\"Character Customization\",\"Realistic\",\"Physics\",\"Building\",\"Driving\",\"Base Building\",\"Family Sharing\",\"nature\",\"Science\",\"Offroad\",\"Automobile Sim\",\"transportation\"]",
  "publisher": "Focus Entertainment",
  "description": "Embark on ever-rewarding scientific expeditions as you adapt to nature's challenges and unravel the mysteries of uncharted lands. Venture into the vast wilderness of arid deserts and rugged forests to the steepest mountains, brimming with hidden treasures and forgotten ruins. Lead research missions as you drive a variety of all-terrain vehicles through treacherous paths, using advanced technologies and high-tech tools to overcome obstacles. Build and manage your base and equip your vehicles with essential gadgets like drones or scanners to ensure your success i… Read more",
