  "name": "Nottolot",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Free to Play\",\"Action-Adventure\",\"3D\",\"Robots\",\"3D Platformer\",\"Mechs\"]",
  "publisher": "Phoenixx",
  "description": "NOTTOLOT is a robot hacking action game. Use the main character's ability to hack enemy robots to escape from the factory! ■Exhilarating hacking action Control enemy robots with the main character's ability to hack them. Sneak up from behind...tackle and hack! ■Enemy robots with various functions Fly in the sky, climb walls, and more, Manipulate enemies to break through gimmicks and clear all three stages! ■Tense factory escape The main character \"Rolly\" longs for the outside world. Can he escape from the robot production factory guarded by enemy… Read more",
