  "publisher": "Joey Drew Studios",
  "description": "Subject: #131389145 . Property of the Gent Corporation. No unauthorized viewing or interaction. Danger. Unstable. SUMMARY Discover the interactable Secrets of the Machine by exploring Gent's creation and solving the puzzles within. Lurking amongst the shadows are glimpses to the past, the present, and the future of the Dark Puddles. But stay alert, this realm changes often... FEATURES Explore The Drawing Room. Solve the Secrets Within. Unravel the Interactive Mystery. Stay Close for Updates.",
