  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Open World\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Classic\",\"Tactical\",\"role-playing\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Post-apocalyptic\",\"Isometric\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Real-Time with Pause\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"CRPG\",\"Tactical RPG\"]",
  "publisher": "Bethesda Softworks",
  "description": "Fallout Tactics: Brotherhood of Steel tells a story about a squad named Brotherhood of Steel which is involved in a war. The game takes place in the well-known Fallout universe yet it does not continue the story of any other Fallout games released previously. For those who pre-ordered this game, a special bonus CD was delivered. It includes bonus mission for the main game and a table top game in the Fallout universe. Fallout Tactics is a game about tactical combat and strategy and this time players have much more limited interaction with NPC characters yet they can still trade with them.… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/fallout-tactics-brotherhood-of-steel",
