  "name": "Tropico 5",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"Funny\",\"Sandbox\",\"Comedy\",\"Steam Workshop\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Includes level editor\",\"Historical\",\"RTS\",\"Management\",\"achievements\",\"Resource Management\",\"Economy\",\"City Builder\",\"Politics\"]",
  "publisher": "Kalypso Media",
  "description": "Tropico 5 is a government simulator with a strong sandbox aspect. As El Presidente, a dictator of the Tropico island, you need to develop it through four eras from the Colonial Era to the Modern Times. The game features such mechanics as trading, managing resources, research, and diplomacy. The multiplayer mode expands these mechanics, allowing players to share resources, help each other and even declare war. Unlike previous installments in the series, Tropico 5 focuses heavily on the citizens. The prosperity of the island depends on their happiness and the balance between … Read more",
