  "name": "Dungeon Defenders II",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"Third Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Funny\",\"Free to Play\",\"Early Access\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"MMORPG\",\"Loot\",\"Tower Defense\",\"MOBA\"]",
  "publisher": "Trendy Entertainment",
  "description": "Etheria is under attack! Build mighty defenses to freeze, burn and disintegrate your foes -- then grab a sword and jump into the action! Level up a team of heroes, deck them out in loot, and destroy the hordes by yourself or in four-player online co-op! Create a Team of Heroes Wizards! Robots! Thieves! Recruit a cast of characters to join you on your quest to save Etheria. Each hero brings unique abilities and defenses to the battlefield. Swap between your heroes on the fly to use all of their tools -- even in combat! Build Your Defenses Construct a deadly grid of laser beams. … Read more",
