  "name": "Baldur's Gate: Enhanced Edition",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Story Rich\",\"cooperative\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Classic\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Character Customization\",\"Captions available\",\"Isometric\",\"Magic\",\"Remake\",\"Real-Time with Pause\",\"Touch-Friendly\",\"CRPG\",\"Party-Based RPG\",\"Dungeons & Dragons\"]",
  "publisher": "Beamdog",
  "description": "Baldur's Gate: Enhanced Edition is a fantasy role-playing game, a remake of the original 1998 release. Plot The plot follows a player-created character in the world of Forgotten Realms, mainly in the location known as the Sword Coast. Set out on a quest for vengeance and resolving a crisis, the hero finds many friends and enemies, and ultimately, reveals his origin and the circumstances of the game’s introduction. Gameplay The player can choose from different classes and in-game races, each with their advantages and disadvantages, and equip the… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/baldurs-gate-enhanced-edition",
