  "name": "Command & Conquer: Red Alert 3 - Uprising",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"Sci-fi\",\"War\",\"RTS\",\"Base Building\",\"Alternate History\",\"FMV\"]",
  "publisher": "Electronic Arts",
  "description": "An expansion to Command & Conquer: Red Alert 3 that can be played without the original game. Uprising features additional campaigns for three factions: the Allies, the Soviets, and the Empire of the Rising Sun. The plot continues the events of Red Alert 3, making Allied victory in previous game canon. The Soviet Union fights for its very existence because Allied corporation FutureTech is developing a weapon that can freeze time. Its leaders want to erase Soviet Russia from the history once and forever. The war in Allied-occupied Japan continues, as there are… Read more",
