  "name": "Quiplash",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"Comedy\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Family Friendly\"]",
  "publisher": "Jackbox Games",
  "description": "For 3-8 Players and an Audience of thousands! The team behind the hit party games YOU DON’T KNOW JACK, Fibbage, and Drawful presents Quiplash, the laugh-a-minute battle of wits and wittiness! Use your phone or tablet to answer simple prompts like “Something you’d be surprised to see a donkey do” or “The worst soup flavor: Cream of _____.” No rules, no correct answers! Say whatever you want! Your answer is pitted against another player’s answer in a head-to-head clash of cleverness and comedy (or just “Which answer is least stupid?”). Other players – and e… Read more",
