  },
  "name": "King's Bounty: The Legend",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Open World\",\"Fantasy\",\"Classic\",\"Tactical\",\"role-playing\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Turn-Based Combat\",\"Tactical RPG\",\"Hex Grid\"]",
  "publisher": "1C-SoftClub",
  "description": "This spiritual successor to the 1990 King's Bounty revived the franchise and spawned a series of sequels. The plot is set in a fantasy world of Endoria, in the kingdom of Darion, and does not continue King’s Bounty. The protagonist is a rookie hero who offers his services to Mark, the king of Darion, and is to become his Royal Treasure Searcher. The player’s goal is to complete quests that will earn his or her character the titular king’s bounty, be it gold or a rank in nobility. Unlike the original TBS game, The Legend combines tactical gameplay with role-playing elements, such… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/kings-bounty-the-legend",
