  },
  "name": "100% Orange Juice",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Funny\",\"Difficult\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"stats\",\"Anime\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Cute\",\"Memes\",\"Valve Anti-Cheat enabled\",\"Card Game\",\"Board Game\"]",
  "publisher": "Fruitbat Factory",
  "description": "100% Orange Juice is a digital multiplayer board game populated by developer Orange Juice's all-star cast. Characters from Flying Red Barrel, QP Shooting, Suguri and Sora come together with all-new characters to duke it out... with dice. This is a world where dogs, people and machines fly through the air. In that world, a small patch of darkness was born. Infinitesimal at first, it gradually began to envelop everything... A youth named Kai, led by the mysterious life form known as Marie Poppo, begins a journey that will span worlds. The black, bottomless darkness… Read more",
