  },
  "name": "Planetary Annihilation",
  "genre": "[\"Strategy\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Co-op\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Sandbox\",\"Tactical\",\"Cross-Platform Multiplayer\",\"Space\",\"Futuristic\",\"RTS\",\"Robots\",\"Stylized\",\"Kickstarter\",\"Grand Strategy\",\"Real-Time\",\"Crowdfunded\"]",
  "publisher": "Uber Entertainment",
  "description": "Set in the distant future, this science fiction strategy was inspired by Total Annihilation (1997) and is designed by one of the original game's engine creators, Jon Mavor. Planetary Annihilation gameplay is largely similar to classic RTS series like Starcraft or Command & Conquer, yet not without its own unique features. This game is focused on interplanetary wars on a larger scale and allows its players to conquer the whole worlds or even destroy them using nukes and Death Star-like devices. The maps are randomly generated, and each map constitutes a whole planet… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/planetary-annihilation",
