  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"2D\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"role-playing\",\"Turn-Based\",\"controller support\",\"Robots\",\"Steampunk\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Heist\"]",
  "publisher": "Image & Form",
  "description": "Steamworld Heist is a pirate-themed turn-based strategy with shooter and platformer elements. You take on the role of a pirate captain, Piper, as she recruits robots and leads them through space to capture enemy ships. The game has a side-scrolling perspective, and most levels are procedurally generated. The main resource in the game’s universe is water, and all power try to get it. But unexpectedly one more side appears in this conflict: aggressive steambots that attack people. Only Piper can find out what’s happening and save the world. To fulfill your mission, you need to form a team of rob… Read more",
