{
  "_id": {
    "$oid": "68e81b4e967c07aa12681929"
  },
  "name": "Barotrauma",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"2D\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Gore\",\"Difficult\",\"Survival\",\"Violent\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Local Co-Op\",\"Local Multiplayer\",\"Early Access\",\"Steam Workshop\",\"Includes level editor\",\"Survival Horror\",\"Management\",\"Dark Humor\",\"submarine\"]",
  "publisher": "FakeFish",
  "description": "Overcome crisis and the unrelenting pressure of a frozen ocean. In Barotrauma you're a submarine crew member beneath the ice of Jupiter's moon Europa. Flee or fight alien lifeforms, explore a strange new world, command your crew, and craft equipment in a tense 2d co-op experience.Key FeaturesCommand and manage your submarine and its various systems in adrenaline-filled co-operative gameplay. Play as the captain or any of the 4 other character classes, with up to 16 players per submarine. Single Player campaign, sandbox mode, and single missions also available. Procedural levels and events ensure no two games will ever be exactly alike Each submarine has multiple crew operated systems, from nuclear reactors to sonar, guns, engines and more Comprehensive crafting system to create tools, drugs and weapons Navigate dangerous environments to achieve mission goals or simply explore and travel deeper into the game world Explore alien ruins and wrecked submarines along the way to discover rare and powerful artifacts and other resources Fully integrated mod tools allow you to create and transform the game via Steam Workshop. Submarine editor, character and procedural animation editor, procedural level editor, sprite and particle editors - unleash your creativity!",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/barotrauma",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/862/8620fd3d08ecce0e806507299333058d.jpg",
