  },
  "name": "Braveland",
  "genre": "[\"Adventure\",\"Strategy\",\"Casual\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"2D\",\"Fantasy\",\"Steam Leaderboards\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Hand-drawn\",\"Touch-Friendly\",\"Hex Grid\"]",
  "publisher": "Tortuga Team",
  "description": "Braveland is a turn-based game inspired by old-school strategies with hexagonal battlefield. You will start as a humble warrior's son whose village was cruelly raided and will end as talented commander of your army. The story will take place in a hand-drawn world and cover many interesting places and characters. Various warriors will join your army - archers, scouts, healers, footmen, arbalesters and more. Turn-based battles in old-school style. Command your troops and defeat enemies in hand to hand battles. 26 various warriors and creatures from archers to golems. … Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/braveland",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c8a/c8a2d3c82dc11dcec380103d92580af2.jpeg",
