  "name": "Fortified",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Strategy\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Co-op\",\"cooperative\",\"Third-Person Shooter\",\"Tower Defense\"]",
  "publisher": "Clapfoot",
  "description": "While the Cold War did not turn into a real war, the Earthmen are invited to fight with the Martians - with all the arsenal of the Cold War and several experimental technologies. Synthesis of genres The game achieved a productive blending of several genres - the third-person shooter, real-time strategy, and tower defense. From the genre of strategy into the game came the need to build a network of defensive structures capable of resisting the pressure of mechanical invaders. From the genre of the shooter from the third person the game took… Read more",
