  "name": "Blackguards",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Story Rich\",\"Fantasy\",\"Difficult\",\"Tactical\",\"Character Customization\",\"Turn-Based\",\"Dark Fantasy\",\"Isometric\",\"Turn-Based Strategy\",\"Turn-Based Tactics\",\"Tactical RPG\",\"Hex Grid\"]",
  "publisher": "Daedalic Entertainment",
  "description": "Blackguards is a tactical RPG based on pen and paper game The Dark Eye and followed by the sequel, Blackguards 2. The protagonist of the game is blamed for killing a princess. To prove his innocence he starts an adventure and investigates the murder. Accompanied by a dwarf and a mage, he slashes the way to the truth through hordes of enemies. The game places the focus on fights. The first feature is that every hit has a 95% chance to work; this means that even a close punch can be failed. The second feature is the interactive entertainment: during fights you can set… Read more",
