  "name": "Mount & Blade II: Bannerlord",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"Third Person\",\"Sandbox\",\"role-playing\",\"Moddable\",\"War\",\"Character Customization\",\"Realistic\",\"Historical\",\"Medieval\",\"Horses\"]",
  "publisher": "TaleWorlds Entertainment",
  "description": "The horns sound, the ravens gather. An empire is torn by civil war. Beyond its borders, new kingdoms rise. Gird on your sword, don your armour, summon your followers and ride forth to win glory on the battlefields of Calradia. Establish your hegemony and create a new world out of the ashes of the old. Mount & Blade II: Bannerlord is the eagerly awaited sequel to the acclaimed medieval combat simulator and role-playing game Mount & Blade: Warband. Set 200 years before, it expands both the detailed fighting system and the world… Read more",
