  "name": "RIFT",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Massively Multiplayer\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"First-Person\",\"Sci-fi\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"FPS\",\"Online Co-Op\",\"Fantasy\",\"Survival\",\"Free to Play\",\"Online multiplayer\",\"Stealth\",\"Tactical\",\"Third-Person Shooter\",\"Early Access\",\"PvP\",\"Anime\",\"Hack and Slash\",\"In-App Purchases\",\"Character Customization\",\"3D\",\"Crafting\",\"Cinematic\",\"Futuristic\",\"Magic\",\"Cyberpunk\",\"mmo\",\"Shoot 'Em Up\",\"MMORPG\",\"Stylized\",\"Bullet Hell\",\"Time Manipulation\"]",
  "publisher": "Trion Worlds",
  "description": "Previously known as Rift: Planes of Telara and just as Heroes of Telara, it's free-to-play MMORPG in a fantasy setting. In the world of the game - Telara - there is a conflict between two factions: the Guardians and the Defiant. The first worship the higher gods of Telara, among the representatives there are high elves, dwarves and the race of Northerner Mathosians. The Defiant, on the contrary, does not adhere to any religion because of historical and cultural reasons or because of personal choice. They put more emphasis on technology and science. Among the… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/rift",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/30f/30fe09ca354adfd72aeb47b34dbf153a.jpg",
