  "publisher": "Feral Interactive",
  "description": "Although Mad Max is not related to the film series, it is based on its universe. Max Rockatansky is trying to reach the \"Plains Of Silence\", place in which he believes he will finally find peace. He is confronted by a group of War Boys led by Scabrous Scrotus. Beating Max up and stealing everything from him, they leave him in the desert to face his death. Recovering from his injuries, he chases Scrotus in a duel but fails to defeat him. Wandering in the desert, he meets a technic named Chumbucket that helps him to build a new machine and revenge Scrotus. Being in such esthetics, Max… Read more",
