  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Atmospheric\",\"RPG\",\"Co-op\",\"Open World\",\"cooperative\",\"Third Person\",\"Partial Controller Support\",\"FPS\",\"Sandbox\",\"Stealth\",\"Third-Person Shooter\",\"Futuristic\",\"Parkour\",\"Driving\",\"Hacking\",\"first person mod\"]",
  "publisher": "Ubisoft Entertainment",
  "description": "In WATCH_DOGS you play as Aiden Pierce. A professional hacker that can do anything that he pleases with the city due to a new electronic system that now controls almost every aspect of the city - ctOS. By using Aiden's phone, you are able to penetrate any device in the whole city and do whatever you want it. For example, you can hack through someone phone and rob his bank account, or gain control camera system and observe things around you. But after one heist that goes wrong, Pierce must hide his family. But while riding to safety, his car is shot by a mercenary called Maur… Read more",
