  "name": "Streets of Rage 4",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fighting\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Co-op\",\"Split Screen\",\"Local Co-Op\",\"Beat 'em up\",\"4 giocatori divano\"]",
  "publisher": "Playdigious",
  "description": "Streets of Rage, known as Bare Knuckle (ベア・ナックル Bea Nakkuru) in Japan, is a trilogy of beat 'em up games developed and published by SEGA in the 1990s. Famously known for its non stop action and electronic dance influenced music - scored by Yuzo Koshiro and Motohiro Kawashima - the series has gained the status of cult classic throughout the years. It is considered one of the best beat 'em up series of all time. After many years, Axel and Blaze are finally picking up the fight where they left. Featuring hand-drawn visuals from the team behind 2017’s… Read more",
