  "publisher": {
    "$numberDouble": "NaN"
  },
  "description": "Hover Bovver 2: Grand Theft Flymo Here is another of the little games I made back at the turn of the century, originally intended for the \"PDA\" devices of the day, but likely far more played on the PC since hardly anyone except uber-nerds and boring business types ever owned the damn things. Mow the lawn as chaotically as possible. The idea is based on my old Commodore 64 game \"Hover Bovver\", and at its simplest level all you have to do is mow all the grass on a level while avoiding your angry neighbour, who wants his mower back. You have a… Read more",
