  "name": "Grand Ages: Medieval",
  "genre": "[\"RPG\",\"Strategy\",\"Simulation\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Multiplayer\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Great Soundtrack\",\"Open World\",\"Sandbox\",\"stats\",\"War\",\"Historical\",\"Medieval\",\"RTS\",\"Management\",\"achievements\",\"Resource Management\",\"Economy\",\"City Builder\",\"Grand Strategy\",\"Political\",\"Trading\",\"Politics\"]",
  "publisher": "Kalypso Media",
  "description": "What is Grand Ages: Medieval? \"Grand Ages: Medieval\" is an entry in Kalypso's \"Grand Ages\" series of finely-crafted strategy games of different genres developed by different studios. This game is not a sequel to the 2009 title \"Grand Ages: Rome\", a classic RTS with a focus on city building. \"Grand Ages: Medieval\" is a larger scale, real-time empire simulation game combining elements of trade, expansion and exploration with a heavy focus on economical domination. Features: Explore a gigantic game world of over 20 million square kilometres, plot stra… Read more",
  "url": "https://rawg.io/games/grand-ages-medieval",
  "image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/936/936fb3bc45c61b713dd5b646ddb91aa5.jpg",
  "tfidf_vector": {
    "rpg": 0.005682125227298396,
    "strategy": 0.013714186345680184,
