  "name": "AER - Memories of Old",
  "genre": "[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Indie\"]",
  "tags": "[\"Singleplayer\",\"Steam Achievements\",\"Full controller support\",\"Steam Cloud\",\"Atmospheric\",\"steam-trading-cards\",\"Open World\",\"Exploration\",\"Female Protagonist\",\"controller support\"]",
  "publisher": "Daedalic Entertainment",
  "description": "The gods of old are forgotten, lost in the events that shattered the world, leaving only fragments of islands in the sky. This mystic world of endless skies, colorful islands and ancient ruins is in danger of falling into darkness. As one of the last few shapeshifters, you are sent on a pilgrimage to the Land of Gods. Uncover the secrets that will help save reality itself.",
